  FT["MY-H3810"] = {"id":"MY-H3810","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 286/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第15号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 15) ORDER 2022","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 15) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 15) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 15) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 15) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 15) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA286","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)286-2022_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 15) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3810-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 15) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 12 September 2022.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H3810-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama,\n\nbagi tempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n (2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 9, Jalan\n\nTampin–Kuala Pilah-Manchis\n\ndi seksyen 3.30 sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam\n\npeta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Tampin ke\n\nKuala Pilah dan sebaliknya\n\nhendaklah menggunakan\n\njalan alternatif sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam\n\npeta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\n12 September 2022\n\nhingga\n\n11 Mac 2023\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 7 September 2022\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.3; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 118]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Menteri Kanan Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 15) ORDER 2022\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 374/2022 published on 18 August 2022, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Senior Minister of Works against\n\nthe making of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Senior Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use\n\nof Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 15) Order 2022.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 12 September 2022.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1)\n\nof the First Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in column (3)\n\nof the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition Period\n\nPart of Route 9,\n\nTampin–Kuala Pilah–Manchis\n\nRoad at section 3.30 as shown\n\non the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nVehicles from Tampin to\n\nKuala Pilah and vice versa\n\nshall use the alternative road\n\nas shown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\n12 September 2022\n\nuntil\n\n11 March 2023\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 7 September 2022\n\n[KKR.110-1/2/79 Jld.3; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 118]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Senior Minister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3811"] = {"id":"MY-H3811","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 286/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年版权（获授权实体）（修正）令","en":"COPYRIGHT (AUTHORIZED ENTITY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","orig":"COPYRIGHT (AUTHORIZED ENTITY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Quyền tác giả (Thực thể được ủy quyền) (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งลิขสิทธิ์ (นิติบุคคลที่ได้รับอนุญาต) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Hak Cipta (Entitas Berwenang) (Perubahan) Tahun 2023","ms":"Perintah Hak Cipta (Entiti Diberi Kuasa) (Pindaan) 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA286","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)286-2023_COPYRIGHT (AUTHORIZED ENTITY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3811-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Persatuan bagi Orang-Orang Buta Malaysia","ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Hak Cipta\n(Entiti yang Diberi Kuasa) (Pindaan) 2023.\n\n(2)  Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 29 September 2023.\n\nPenggantian Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H3811-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Perpustakaan Negara Malaysia","ms":"2. Perintah Hak Cipta (Entiti yang Diberi Kuasa) 2022 [P.U. (A) 220/2022 ]\ndipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual dengan jadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL\n[Perenggan 2]"}},{"id":"MY-H3811-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Persatuan Orang-Orang Cacat Penglihatan Islam Malaysia"}},{"id":"MY-H3811-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. St. Nicholas' Home, Penang\".\n\nDibuat 27 September 2023\n[KPDNKK.100-1/4/17; PN(PU2)457/V]\n\n                                                             DATUK ARMIZAN BIN MOHD ALI\n                                                               Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Kos Sara Hidup\n\nCOPYRIGHT ACT 1987\n\nCOPYRIGHT (AUTHORIZED ENTITY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the  powers conferred by subsection 13 (2C) of the Copyright Act 1987\n[Act 332], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Copyright (Authorized Entity)\n(Amendment) Order 2023.\n\n(2)  This Order comes into operation on 29 September 2023.\n\nSubstitution of Schedule\n2. The Copyright (Authorized Entity) Order 202 2 [P.U. (A) 220/2022 ] is amended\nby substituting for the Schedule the following schedule:\n\n\"SCHEDULE\n[Paragraph 2]\n\n1. Malaysian Association for the Blind\n2. National Library of Malaysia\n3. Persatuan Orang-Orang Cacat Penglihatan Islam Malaysia\n4. St. Nicholas' Home, Penang\".\n\nMade 27 September 2023\n[KPDNKK.100-1/4/17; PN(PU2)457/V]\n\n                                                                             DATUK ARMIZAN BIN MOHD ALI\n                                                                                     Minister of Domestic Trade and Cost of Living"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3812"] = {"id":"MY-H3812","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 286/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年教育（2025/2026学年教育机构校历条款）条例","en":"EDUCATION (TERMS OF EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS ACADEMIC CALENDAR 2025/2026) REGULATIONS 2024","orig":"EDUCATION (TERMS OF EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS ACADEMIC CALENDAR 2025/2026) REGULATIONS 2024","ms":"Peraturan Pendidikan (Terma Kalendar Akademik Institusi Pendidikan 2025/2026) 2024","vi":"Quy định về Giáo dục (Điều kiện lịch học năm học 2025/2026 của các cơ sở giáo dục) năm 2024","th":"ข้อบังคับการศึกษา (ข้อกำหนดปฏิทินการศึกษาของสถาบันการศึกษา ปีการศึกษา 2568/2569) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Peraturan Pendidikan (Ketentuan Kalender Akademik Institusi Pendidikan 2025/2026) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA286","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)286-2024_EDUCATION (TERMS OF EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS ACADEMIC CALENDAR 2025 2026) REGULATIONS 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3812-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan Pendidikan\n\n(Penggal Institusi Pendidikan Kalendar Akademik 2025/2026) 2024.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H3812-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan ini hendaklah terpakai bagi kehadiran di institusi\n\npendidikan kecuali di sekolah swasta, sekolah ekspatriat dan sekolah antarabangsa bagi\n\nkalendar akademik 2025/2026.\n\nTempoh penggal institusi pendidikan"}},{"id":"MY-H3812-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Tempoh penggal institusi pendidikan bagi kalendar akademik 2025/2026 adalah\n\nsebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nKumpulan A\n\nSemua institusi pendidikan di Johor,\n\nKedah, Kelantan dan Terengganu\n\nPenggal Pertama\n\n16 Februari 2025 hingga 28 Mei 2025\n\nPenggal Kedua\n\n10 Jun 2025 hingga 11 September 2025\n\nPenggal Ketiga\n\n21 September 2025 hingga 18 Disember 2025\n\nKumpulan B\n\nSemua institusi pendidikan di\n\nMelaka, Negeri Sembilan, Pahang,\n\nPerak, Perlis, Pulau Pinang,\n\nSabah, Sarawak, Selangor, Wilayah\n\nPersekutuan Kuala Lumpur,\n\nWilayah Persekutuan Labuan dan\n\nWilayah Persekutuan Putrajaya\n\nPenggal Pertama\n\n17 Februari 2025 hingga 28 Mei 2025\n\n Penggal Kedua\n\n10 Jun 2025 hingga 12 September 2025\n\nPenggal Ketiga\n\n22 September 2025 hingga 19 Disember 2025\n\nDibuat 27 September 2024\n\n[KPM.PUU.S.100-1/19/8(48); PN(PU2)569/JLD.15]\n\n FADHLINA BINTI SIDEK\n\n Menteri Pendidikan\n\nEDUCATION ACT 1996\n\nEDUCATION (TERMS OF EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS\n\nACADEMIC CALENDAR 2025/2026) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 130(2)(b) of the\n\nEducation Act 1996 [Act 550], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Education (Terms of Educational\n\nInstitutions Academic Calendar 2025/2026) Regulations 2024.\n\nApplication\n\n2. These Regulations shall apply to attendance at educational institutions except\n\nat private schools, expatriate schools and international schools for the academic\n\ncalendar 2025/2026.\n\nDuration of terms of educational institutions\n\n3. The duration of terms of educational institutions for the academic\n\ncalendar 2025/2026 shall be as specified in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nGroup A\n\nAll educational institutions in Johore,\n\nKedah, Kelantan and Terengganu\n\nFirst Term\n\n16 February 2025 to 28 May 2025\n\nSecond Term\n\n10 June 2025 to 11 September 2025\n\nThird Term\n\n21 September 2025 to 18 December 2025\n\nGroup B\n\nAll educational institutions in\n\nMalacca, Negeri Sembilan, Pahang,\n\nPerak, Perlis, Penang, Sabah, Sarawak,\n\nSelangor, Federal Territory of\n\nKuala Lumpur, Federal Territory of\n\nLabuan and Federal Territory of\n\nPutrajaya\n\nFirst Term\n\n17 February 2025 to 28 May 2025\n\nSecond Term\n\n10 June 2025 to 12 September 2025\n\nThird Term\n\n22 September 2025 to 19 December 2025\n\nMade 27 September 2024\n\n[KPM.PUU.S.100-1/19/8(48); PN(PU2)569/JLD.15]\n\n FADHLINA BINTI SIDEK\n\n Minister of Education"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3813"] = {"id":"MY-H3813","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 286/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（安邦—吉隆坡高架大道）（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (AMPANG-KUALA LUMPUR ELEVATED HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (AMPANG-KUALA LUMPUR ELEVATED HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Bertingkat Ampang-Kuala Lumpur) (Pindaan) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc trên cao Ampang-Kuala Lumpur) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางหลวงยกระดับอัมปัง-กัวลาลัมเปอร์) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Raya Layang Ampang-Kuala Lumpur) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA286","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en；已清除正文中的 1 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)286-2025_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (AMPANG-KUALA LUMPUR ELEVATED HIGHWAY).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3813-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuhraya Bertingkat AmpangKuala Lumpur) (Pindaan) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 31 Ogos 2025.\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H3813-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuhraya Bertingkat Ampang-Kuala Lumpur) 2001 [P.U. (A) 166/2001] dipinda dalam\n\nJadual Ketiga dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 6 butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"7. Mana-mana kenderaan Kerajaan yang mempunyai lambang rasmi\n\nJabatan Pengangkutan Jalan yang dilekatkan pada bahagian kiri dan kanan\n\nbadan kenderaan itu, dan dilekatkan secara kekal dengan lampu amaran\n\nkhas yang memancarkan cahaya berkelip biru pada bumbung kenderaan itu,\n\nbagi maksud menjalankan tugas penguatkuasaan.\".\n\nDibuat 26 Ogos 2025\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/43; PN(PU2)426/JLD.73]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(AMPANG-KUALA LUMPUR ELEVATED HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Federal Roads\n\n(Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3814"] = {"id":"MY-H3814","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 286/2026&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年联邦道路（沙巴）（修正）（第3号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (SABAH) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2026","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (SABAH) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Sabah) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 3) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Sabah) (Sửa đổi) (số 3) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (ซาบาห์) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Sabah) (Perubahan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA286","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2026_P.U.(A)286-2026_FEDERAL ROADS (SABAH) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3814-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Sabah)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 3) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 10 Ogos 2026.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H3814-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Sabah) 1996 [P.U. (A) 366/1996], yang disebut\n\n\"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas butiran (o) butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(p) (Laluan 1): Jalan Inanam-Sepanggar\n\nBermula di koordinat U 5.981596, T 116.160554 dan berakhir di koordinat\n\nU 6.055736, T 116.173097 termasuk jalan sambungannya\n\ndi dalam sempadan hak lalu-lalang sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam\n\nPETA 11: JALAN INANAM-SEPANGGAR.\n\nJarak sepanjang 10.143 kilometer.\n\n(q) (Laluan 505): Jalan ke Lebuh Raya Pan Borneo dari Bukit Padang\n\nBermula di koordinat U 5.941799, T 116.118669 dan berakhir di koordinat\n\nU 5.941322, T 116.137147 termasuk jalan sambungannya\n\ndi dalam sempadan hak lalu-lalang sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam\n\nPETA 12: JALAN KE LEBUH RAYA PAN BORNEO DARI BUKIT PADANG.\n\nJarak sepanjang 2.150 kilometer.\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H3814-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Ketiga dengan memasukkan selepas\n\nPETA 10: JALAN TAWAU-SANDAKAN peta yang berikut:\n\n\"PETA 11: JALAN INANAM-SEPANGGAR\n\n\".\n\nPETA 12: JALAN KE LEBUH RAYA PAN BORNEO DARI BUKIT PADANG\n\nDibuat 5 Ogos 2026\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/23; PN(PU2)391/JLD.55]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (SABAH) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959\n\n[Act 376], the Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Sabah,\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3815"] = {"id":"MY-H3815","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2011&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年服务税（修正）条例","en":"SERVICE TAX (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2011","orig":"SERVICE TAX (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2011","ms":"Peraturan Cukai Perkhidmatan (Pindaan) 2011","vi":"Quy định về Thuế dịch vụ (Sửa đổi) năm 2011","th":"ข้อบังคับภาษีบริการ (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Peraturan Pajak Jasa (Perubahan) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2011_P.U.(A)287-2011_SERVICE TAX (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3815-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nCukai Perkhidmatan (Pindaan) 2011.\n\n (2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n16 Mac 2009.\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H3815-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Cukai Perkhidmatan 1975 [P.U. (A) 52/1975] dipinda dalam\nJadual Ketiga\n\n(a) berhubung dengan negeri SELANGOR, dengan menggantikan butir-butir\nyang terdapat di bawah tajuk \"E. SELANGOR\" dengan butir -butir yang\nberikut:\n\nLetaknya Pejabat\nLocation of Offices\n\nDaerah-Daerah Yang Dikhidmati\nDistricts Served\n\"E.  SELANGOR\n  Pelabuhan Klang\n\nKlang\nKuala Langat (kecuali Banting,\nJenjarom dan Tg Sepat)\nKuala Selangor\nPetaling (Majlis Bandaraya Shah\nAlam dan Majlis Perbandaran\nSubang Jaya)\";\n\n(b) berhubung dengan negeri WILAYAH PERSEKUTUAN KUALA LUMPUR,\ndengan menggantikan butir-butir yang terdapat di bawah tajuk\n\"F. WILAYAH PERSEKUTUAN KUALA LUMPUR \" dengan butir -butir yang\nberikut:\n\nLetaknya Pejabat\nLocation of Offices\n\nDaerah-Daerah Yang Dikhidmati\nDistricts Served\n\"F.  WILAYAH PERSEKUTUAN\nKUALA LUMPUR\n  Kuala Lumpur\n\nGombak\nPetaling (kecuali Majlis\nBandaraya Shah Alam dan Majlis\nPerbandaran Subang Jaya)\nHulu Langat (kecuali Bangi,\nBeranang, Kajang dan Semenyeh\nHulu Selangor)\nWilayah Persekutuan\"; dan\n\n (c) dengan memasukkan selepas tajuk \"L. KELANTAN\" dan butir -butir yang\nberhubungan dengannya butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nLetaknya Pejabat\nLocation of Offices\n\nDaerah-Daerah Yang Dikhidmati\nDistricts Served\n\"LA.  LAPANGAN TERBANG\nANTARABANGSA KUALA\nLUMPUR\nInternational Airport\n(KLIA)\n\nHulu Langat (Bangi,\nBeranang, Kajang dan\nSemenyeh)\nKuala Langat (Banting, Jenjarom\n\ndan Tg Sepat)\nSepang\nSungai Pelek\nDengkil\nPuchong (Majlis\nPerbandaran Sepang)\nPutrajaya\nCyberjaya\".\n\nDibuat  1 Julai  2011\n[5 SULIT KE.HT(96)667/01 SK35;Perb.CR(8.09)198-43Jld.13(SK.2); PN(PU2)268/IV]\n\nDATO' SERI HAJI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n                 Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nSERVICE TAX ACT 1975\n\nSERVICE TAX (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2011\n\nIN exercise of the  powers conferred by section  41 of the Service  Tax  Act  1975\n[Act 151], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3816"] = {"id":"MY-H3816","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2012&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年审计（附表一修正）令","en":"AUDIT (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2012","orig":"AUDIT (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Audit (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm toán (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ nhất) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งการตรวจสอบ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกแรก) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Audit (Perubahan Lampiran Pertama) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2012_P.U.(A)287-2012_AUDIT (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3816-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Audit (Pindaan Jadual\n\nPertama) 2012.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2012.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H3816-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Audit 1957 dipinda dalam subperenggan 1(2)\n\ndengan menggantikan perkataan \"tiga belas ribu tujuh ratus tujuh puluh ringgit dan dua\n\npuluh sembilan sen\" dengan perkataan \"enam belas ribu enam puluh satu ringgit dan\n\nenam puluh enam sen\".\n\nDibuat 14 Ogos 2012\n\n[PM(BK)R. 10332 Jld. 18; PN(PU2)350/III]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\n\n Setiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Hendaklah dibentangkan di hadapan setiap Majlis Parlimen menurut subperenggan 1(3)\n\nJadual Pertama kepada Akta Audit 1957]\n\nAUDIT ACT 1957\n\nAUDIT (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 11 of the Audit Act 1957 [Act 62], the\n\nYang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3817"] = {"id":"MY-H3817","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年所得税（豁免）（第12号）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2013","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 12) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (số 12) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 12) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 12) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 8 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)287-2013_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3817-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 12) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa mulai tahun\ntaksiran 2012.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah ini terpakai bagi syarikat yang layak—\n\n(a) yang menjalankan suatu perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak;\n\n(b) yang memperoleh perusahaan kecil dan sederhana  yang menjalankan\nsuatu perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak  yang sama  menurut suatu\nskim pemerolehan;\n\n(c) yang skim pe merolehannya telah ditentusahkan oleh Perbadanan\nPerusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana Malaysia; dan\n\n(d) yang pemerolehannya selesai pada atau selepas 3 Julai 201 2 tetapi tidak\nlewat dari 2 Julai 2015.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3.  Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n\"perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak \" ertinya suatu perniagaan berhubung\ndengan perkhidmatan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual;\n\n\"perusahaan kecil dan sederhana\" mempunyai erti yang sama yang diberikan\nkepadanya di bawah seksyen  2 Akta Perbadanan Perusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana\nMalaysia 1995 [Akta 539];\n\n\"skim pemerolehan\" ertinya suatu skim yang melibatkan pemerolehan suatu\nperusahaan kecil dan sederhana oleh suatu perusahaan kecil dan sederhana yang lain\nmengikut amalan yang diterima umum di Malaysia;\n\n\"syarikat yang layak\"  ertinya—\n\n(a) suatu perusahaan kecil dan sederhana yang diperbadankan sebagai\nsyarikat di bawah Akta Syarikat 1965 [Akta 125]; dan\n\n(b) bermastautin di Malaysia.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4.  (1)  Tertakluk kepada perenggan  8, Menteri mengecualikan suatu syarikat\nyang layak , berkenaan dengan pendapatan berkanun yang diperoleh daripada\nmenjalankan perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak bagi tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun\ntaksiran, daripada pembayaran cukai pendapatan bagi tempoh li ma tahun taksiran\nberturut-turut mulai dari tarikh pemerolehan diselesaikan.\n\n(2) Tertakluk kepada perenggan 5  dan 6, pendapatan berkanun yang disebut\ndalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah ditentukan mengikut formula yang berikut:\n\n(a) berhubung dengan suatu syarikat yang layak  yang mempunyai\nmodal berbayar  berkenaan dengan syer biasa nya sebanyak dua\njuta lima ratus ribu  ringgit dan kurang selepas pe merolehan\ndiselesaikan—\n\n(i) bagi tiap-tiap ringgit dalam RM500,000.00 yang pertama\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai, kadar cukai\n\nsemasa bagi amaun itu sebagaimana yang diperuntukkan\ndalam perenggan 2A Bahagian I Jadual 1 Akta terpakai;\n\n(ii) bagi tiap-tiap ringgit yang melebihi RM500,000 .00\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai , pendapatan\nberkanun hendaklah dikira mengikut formula yang berikut:\n\n     A X C\n     B\n\niaitu              A  ialah amaun cukai yang dikenakan\nbagi tiap-tiap ringgit yang melebihi\nRM500,000.00 pendapatan yang\nboleh dikenakan cukai syarikat yang\nlayak itu pada kadar cukai semasa\nsebagaimana yang diperuntukkan\ndalam perenggan 2A Bahagian I\nJadual 1 Akta ditolak dengan amaun\ncukai yang dikenakan ke atas\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan\ncukai itu bagi tiap-tiap ringgit yang\nmelebihi RM500,000 .00 pada kadar\ndua puluh peratus;\n\nB ialah amaun cukai yan g dikenakan\nbagi tiap-tiap ringgit yang melebihi\nRM500,000.00 pendapatan yang boleh\ndikenakan cukai itu pada kadar cukai\nsemasa sebagaimana yang\ndiperuntukkan dalam  perenggan 2A\nBahagian I Jadual 1 Akta; dan\n\nC  ialah amaun pendapatan yang boleh\ndikenakan cukai itu yang melebihi\nRM500,000.00.\n\n(b) berhubung dengan suatu syarikat yang layak  yang mempunyai\nmodal berbayar berkenaan dengan syer biasa nya lebih daripada\ndua juta lima ratus ribu  ringgit selepas pe merolehan\ndiselesaikan—\n\n    A X C\n    B\n\niaitu                  A ialah amaun cukai yang dikenakan ke atas\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai bagi\nsyarikat yang layak  itu pada kadar  cukai\nsemasa sebagaimana yang diperuntukkan\ndalam perenggan 2 Bahagian I Jadual 1 Akta\nditolak dengan amaun cukai yang dikenakan\nke atas pendapatan yang boleh dikenakan\ncukai itu pada kadar dua puluh peratus;\n\nB ialah amaun cukai yang dikenakan ke atas\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai itu\npada kadar cukai semasa sebagaimana yang\ndiperuntukkan dalam perenggan 2 Bahagian I\nJadual 1 Akta; dan\n\nC  ialah amaun pendapatan yang boleh\ndikenakan cukai itu.\n\n(3) Tiada apa -apa jua dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan syarikat yang layak  itu daripada mematuhi apa -apa\n\nkehendak untuk mengemukakan apa -apa p enyata atau penyata akaun atau memberi\napa-apa maklumat lain di bawah peruntukan Akta.\n\nJumlah pendapatan berkanun syarikat yang layak"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Bagi maksud perenggan 4,  jumlah pendapatan berkanun syarikat yang\nlayak hendaklah ditentukan selepas memotong elaun yang boleh diberikan di bawah\nJadual 3 Akta walaupun tiada tuntutan bagi elaun itu dibuat.\n\n (2) Jika aset yang digunakan bagi maksud perniagaan perkhidmatan yang\nlayak yang disebut dalam subperenggan 4(1) digunakan juga bagi maksud suatu\nperniagaan selain perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak itu, maka elaun yang diberikan\ndi bawah Jadual 3 Akta  hendaklah di potong sebagaimana yang munasabah dengan\nmengambil kira takat aset itu digunakan bagi maksud perniagaan perkhidmatan yang\nlayak itu.\n\nPendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Bagi maksud perenggan 4, p endapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai\nsyarikat yang layak  daripada punca yang terdiri daripada  perniagaan perkhidmatan\nyang layak  dan apa-apa punca lain yang terdiri daripada apa-apa aktiviti atau\nperniagaan lain bagi suatu tahun taksiran , hendaklah merupakan pendapatan berkanun\ndaripada punca itu ditolak dengan mana -mana potongan yang diberi menurut\nsubseksyen 43(2)  dan 44(1) Akta yang berhubungan dengan punca itu:\n\n Dengan syarat  bahawa pemegang syer syarikat itu , pada hari terakhir tempoh\nasas bagi tahun taksiran yang di dalamnya skim pe merolehan itu berlaku yang jumlah\nkerugian larasan ditentukan, hendaklah sebahagian besarnya sama seperti pemegang\nsyer syarikat itu pada hari pertama tempoh  asas bagi tahun taksiran yang amaun itu\nsebaliknya boleh dipotong di bawah subseksyen itu, dan amaun itu yang telah tidak\ndiambil kira tidak boleh dibenarkan potongan dalam tahun -tahun taksiran berikutnya\nmenurut subseksyen 44(5A), (5B) dan (5C) Akta.\n\n (2) Bagi maksud subperenggan (1), dalam membuat potongan di bawah\nsubseksyen 43(2) Akta, kerugian larasan tidak boleh diambil kira, jika ada, dari pada\n\npunca perniagaan perusahaan kecil dan sederhana yang diperoleh  oleh syarikat yang\nlayak itu.\n\nPunca dan akaun yang berasingan"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Jika suatu syarikat yang layak  menjalankan suatu perniagaan\nperkhidmatan yang layak  dan apa -apa aktiviti atau perniagaan lain, pendapatan yang\ndiperoleh daripada perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak  itu dan setiap aktiviti atau\nperniagaan yang lain itu hendaklah dianggap sebagai suatu punca aktiviti atau\nperniagaan yang berasingan dan berlainan syarikat yang layak itu.\n\n(2) Syarikat yang layak  yang dikecualikan di bawah subperenggan 4(1)\nhendaklah menyenggara suatu akaun berasingan bagi pendapatan yang diperoleh\ndaripada perniagaan perkhidmatan yang layak yang disebut dalam subperenggan itu.\n\nKetidaklayakan untuk mendapat pengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3817-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Syarikat yang layak dalam tempoh asas bagi sesuatu tahun taksiran tidak layak\nmendapat pengecualian di bawah Perintah ini jika, bagi tahun taksiran itu, syarikat yang\nlayak itu—\n\n(a) telah membuat suatu tuntutan bagi elaun pelaburan semula di bawah\nJadual 7A atau elaun pelaburan di bawah Jadual 7B Akta;\n\n(b) telah diberikan apa -apa insentif di bawah Akta Penggalakan Pelaburan\n1986 [Akta 327];\n\n(c) telah diberikan suatu pengecualian di bawah seksyen 127 Akta; atau\n\n(d) telah membuat suatu tuntutan bagi potongan di bawah mana -mana\nkaedah-kaedah yang dibuat di bawah seksyen 154 Akta kecuali elaun\ndi bawah Jadual 3 Akta.\n\nJADUAL\n\n1.   Perkhidmatan profesional—\n\n(a) perakaunan dan percukaian\n\n(b) pakar perubatan dan pergigian\n\n(c) seni bina\n\n(d) kejuruteraan\n\n2.    Perkhidmatan kiriman cepat\n\n3. Perkhidmatan pendidikan menengah teknikal dan vokasional\n(keperluan generik dan khas)  sebagaimana yang diperaku i oleh\nKementerian yang dipertanggungkan dengan tanggungjawab bagi\npendidikan menengah teknikal dan vokasional\n\n4. Perkhidmatan latihan kemahiran  sebagaimana yang diperaku i oleh\nKementerian yang dipertanggungkan dengan tanggungjawab bagi\nlatihan kemahiran\n\nDibuat 30 Ogos 2013\n[Perb   0.3865/408 JLD.7 (SK.3); LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/231-41; PN(PU2)80/LXXII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n     Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan\n1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO.  12) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Income Tax (Exemption) (No. 12)\nOrder 2013.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation from the year of\nassessment 2012.\n\nApplication\n2. This Order applies to a qualifying company—\n\n(a) which carries on a business of qualifying services;\n\n(b) which acquires a small and medium enterprise  carrying on a business of\nsame qualifying services pursuant to a scheme of acquisition;\n\n(c) whose scheme of acquisition has been verified by the Small and Medium\nEnterprises Corporation Malaysia; and\n\n(d) whose acquisition is completed on or after 3 July 201 2 but not later than\n2 July 2015.\n\nInterpretation\n3.        In this Order—\n\n\"business of qualifying services\"  means a business in relation to services as\nspecified in the Schedule;\n\n\"small and medium enterprise s\" has the same meaning assigned to it under\nsection 2 of the Small and Medium Enterprises Corporation Malaysia Act 1995\n[Act 539];\n\n\"scheme of acquisition\" means a scheme involving an acquisition of a  small and\nmedium enterprise  by another small and medium enterprise  in accordance with\ngenerally accepted practice in Malaysia;\n\n\"qualifying company\" means—\n\n(a) a small and medium enterprise  incorporated as a company under the\nCompanies Act 1965 [Act 125]; and\n\n(b) resident in Malaysia.\n\nExemption\n4.  (1)  Subject to paragraph s 8, t he Minister exempts a qualifying company , in\nrespect of statutory income derived from  the carrying on of business of qualifying\nservices for the basis period for a year of assessment, from the payment of income tax\nfor a period of five consecutive years of assessment commencing from the date the\nacquisition is completed.\n\n(2) Subject to paragraphs 5 and 6 , the statutory income referred to in\nsubparagraph (1) shall be determined in accordance with the following formula:\n\n(a) in relation to a qualifying company which has a  paid-up capital in\nrespect of its ordinary shares of two million five hundred thousand\nringgit and less after the acquisition is completed—\n\n(i) for every ringgit of the first RM500,000 .00 of the\nchargeable income , the prevailing  tax rate for the said\namount as provided for in  paragraph 2A  of Part I of\nSchedule 1 to the Act applies;\n\n(ii) for every ringgit exceeding RM500,000.00 of the chargeable\nincome, the statutory income  shall be calculated in\naccordance with the following formula:\n\n     A X C\n     B\n\nwhere            A  is the amount of tax charged for every\nringgit exceeding RM50 0,000.00 of\nthe chargeable income of the\nqualifying company at the prevailing\ntax rate as provided for in paragraph\n2A of Part I  of Schedule 1 to the Act\nreduced by the amount of tax charged\non such chargeable income  for every\nringgit exceeding RM500,000 .00 at\nthe rate of twenty per cent;\n\nB is the amount of tax charged for every\nringgit exceeding RM500,000 .00 of\nsuch chargeable income at the\nprevailing tax rate as provided for in\nparagraph 2A of Part I of Schedule 1 to\nthe Act; and\n\nC  is the amount of such chargeable\nincome exceeding RM500,000.00.\n\n(b) in relation to a qualifying company which has a  paid-up capital in\nrespect of  its ordinary shares of more than two million five\nhundred thousand ringgit after the acquisition is completed—\n\n   A X C\n   B\n\nwhere              A is the amount of tax charged on the\nchargeable income of the qualifying\ncompany at the prevailing  tax rate as\nprovided for in paragraph 2 of Part I\nof Schedule 1 to the Act reduced by\nthe amount of tax charged on such\nchargeable income at the rate of\ntwenty per cent;\n\nB is the amount of tax charged on such\nchargeable income at the prevailing\ntax rate as provided for in paragraph 2\nof Part I of Schedule 1 to the Act; and\n\nC is the amount of such chargeable\nincome.\n\n(3) Nothing in subparagraph (1) shall absolve or is deemed to  have absolved\nthe qualifying company from complying with any requirement to submit any return or\nstatement of accounts or to furnish a ny other information under the provision s of\nthe Act.\n\nTotal statutory income of the qualifying company\n5. (1) For the purpose of paragraph 4 , t he total statutory income of the\nqualifying company shall be determined after deducting the allowances which fall to be\nmade under Schedule 3 to the Act notwithstanding that no claim for such allowances\nhas been made.\n\n (2) Where an asset used for the purpose of a business of qualifying services\nreferred to in subparagraph 4(1) is also used for t he purpose of a business other than\n\nthat business of qualifying services, then the allowances which fall to be made under\nSchedule 3 to the Act shall be deducted as is reasonable having regard to the extent to\nwhich the asset is used for the purpose of that business of qualifying services.\n\nChargeable income\n6. (1) For the purpose of paragraph 4, t he chargeable income of a qualifying\ncompany from its  source consisting of business of qualifying services and any other\nsource consisting of any other activity or business for a year of assessment, shall be the\nstatutory income from that source reduced by any deduction falling to be made\npursuant to subsections 43(2) and 44(1) of the Act relating to that source:\n\n Provided that the shareholders of that qualifying company, on the last day of the\nbasis period for the year of assessment where the scheme of acquisition falls in which\nthe amount of adjusted loss is ascertained, shall be substantially the same as the\nshareholders of that company on the first day of the basis period for the year of\nassessment in which such amount would otherwise be deductible under that\nsubsection, and such amount disregarded shall not be allowed as a deduction in\nsubsequent years of assessment pursuant to subsection s 44(5A), (5B) and (5C)\nof the Act.\n\n (2) For the purpose of subparagraph (1), in making the deduction under\nsubsection 43(2) of the Act, no regard shall be made to the adjusted loss, if any, from the\nsource of the business of the small and medium enterprise  which is acquired by  the\nqualifying company.\n\nSeparate source and account\n7. (1) If a qualifying company carries on business of qualifying services and any\nother activity or business, the income derived from the business of qualifying services\nand each of such other activity or business shall be treated as a separate and distinct\nsource of activity or business of that qualifying company.\n\n(2) The qualifying company which is exempted under subparagraph 4(1)\nshall maintain a separate account for the income derived from the business of qualifying\nservices referred to in that subparagraph.\n\nDisqualification from exemption\n8. A qualifying company in the basis period for the year of assessment shall not\nqualify to be exempted under this Order where, for that year of assessment ,\nthe qualifying company—\n\n(a) has made a claim for reinvestment allowance under Schedule 7A or\ninvestment allowance under Schedule 7B to the Act;\n\n(b) has been granted any incentive under the Promotion of Investment s\nAct 1986 [Act 327];\n\n(c) has been granted an exemption under section 127 of the Act; or\n\n(d) has made a claim for deduction under any rules made under section 154\nof the Act except  for allowances under Schedule 3 to the Act.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Professional services—\n\n(a)  accounting and taxation\n\n(b)  medical and dental specialists\n\n(c)  architectural\n\n(d)  engineering\n\n2. Courier services\n\n3. Technical and vocational secondary education services (generic and special\nneeds) as certified by the Ministry charged with the responsibility for\ntechnical and vocational secondary education\n\n4. Skills training services  as certified by the Ministry charged with the\nresponsibility for skills training\n\nMade 30 August 2013\n[Perb  0.3865/408 JLD.7 (SK.3) ; LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/231-41; PN(PU2)80/LXXII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n     Second Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursu ant to subsection 127(4) of the Income Tax\nAct 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3818"] = {"id":"MY-H3818","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年消费税（修正）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Cukai (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)287-2014_EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3818-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Eksais (Pindaan) 2014.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2014.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H3818-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Duti Eksais 2012 [P.U. (A) 350/2012] dipinda dalam Jadual, dalam\n\nruang (4)―\n\n(a) berhubung dengan subkepala 2402.10 000 dan 2402.90 100, dengan\n\nmenggantikan perkataan \"RM250.00 and 20%\" dengan perkataan\n\n\"RM280.00 and 20%\"; dan\n\n(b) berhubung dengan subkepala 2402.20 200, 2402.20 900 dan\n\n2402.90 200, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"RM0.25 per stk and 20%\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"RM0.28 per stk and 20%\".\n\nDibuat30 Oktober 2014\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/19-8 Klt.2 SK.59; TS384(SK.1); PN(PU2)337/XIX]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 6(2) Akta Eksais 1976]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(1) of the Excise Act 1976\n\n[Act 176], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3819"] = {"id":"MY-H3819","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2015&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年限速（沙登互通）令","en":"SPEED LIMIT (SERI KEMBANGAN INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015","orig":"SPEED LIMIT (SERI KEMBANGAN INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Had Laju (Persimpangan Seri Kembangan) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ (Nút giao Seri Kembangan) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็ว (ทางแยกต่างระดับเซอรีเกิมบังอัน) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan (Simpang Susun Seri Kembangan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)287-2015_SPEED LIMIT (SERI KEMBANGAN INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3819-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju (Persimpangan\n\nBertingkat Seri Kembangan) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 13 Disember 2015.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H3819-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Pemanduan suatu kenderaan motor dengan kelajuan yang melebihi had\n\nlaju yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama di atas jalan yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama adalah dilarang.\n\n(2) Jalan dengan had laju yang dinyatakan di bawah subperenggan (1)\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1) (2)\n\nJalan Had Laju\n\n(km/j)\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Persimpangan Bertingkat Seri\n\nKembangan, Lebuh Raya Maju Expressway bermula dari—\n\n(a) kilometer 14.83 di koordinat S 72247.638, T 19729.854 Grid\n\nRectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan\n\nberakhir di koordinat S 73844.251, T 19817.681 Grid RSO\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000);\n\n(b) koordinat S 73844.251, T 19817.681 Grid RSO Geosentrik\n\n(GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 14.83 di koordinat\n\nS 72245.880, T 19702.410 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000);\n\n(c) kilometer 16.83 di koordinat S 74141.532, T 19584.429 Grid RSO\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di koordinat S 73844.251,\n\nT 19817.681 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000)\n\n(d) koordinat S 73844.251, T 19817.681 Grid RSO Geosentrik\n\n(GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 17.06 di koordinat\n\nS 74372.982, T 19611.385 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000); dan\n\n(e) koordinat S 73844.251, T 19817.681 Grid RSO (GDM 2000) dan\n\nberakhir di Had Sempadan Penyenggaraan (HSP) di koordinat\n\nS 75037.959, T 20161.944 Grid RSO (GDM 2000).\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nPERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT SERI KEMBANGAN\n\nDibuat 2 Disember 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/19; PN(PU2)460/LXXXIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nSPEED LIMIT (SERI KEMBANGAN INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Speed Limit (Seri Kembangan\n\nInterchange) Order 2015.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 13 December 2015.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. (1) The driving of a motor vehicle at a speed exceeding the speed limit\n\nspecified in column (2) of the First Schedule on the road specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule is prohibited.\n\n(2) The road with speed limit as specified under subparagraph (1) is shown\n\non the map in the Second Schedule.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1) (2)\n\nRoad Speed limit\n\n(km/h)\n\nThe part of the road known as the Seri Kembangan Interchange,\n\nMaju Expressway which commence from—\n\n(a) kilometer 14.83 at coordinates S 72247.638, E 19729.854 of the\n\nRectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid\n\nand ending at coordinates S 73844.251, E 19817.681 of the RSO\n\nGeocentric (GDM 2000) Grid;\n\n(b) coordinates S 73844.251, E 19817.681 of the RSO Geocentric\n\n(GDM 2000) Grid and ending at kilometer 14.83 at coordinates\n\nS 72245.880, E 19702.410 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid;\n\n(c) kilometer 16.83 at coordinates S 74141.532, E 19584.429 of the\n\nRSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid and ending at coordinates\n\nS 73844.251, E 19817.681 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid;\n\n(d) coordinates S 73844.251, E 19817.681 of the RSO Geocentric\n\n(GDM 2000) Grid and ending at kilometer 17.06 at coordinates\n\nS 74372.982, E 19611.385 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid; and\n\n(e) coordinates S 73844.251, E 19817.681 of the RSO Geocentric\n\n(GDM 2000) Grid and ending at Limit of Maintenance\n\nResponsibility (LMR) at coordinates S 75037.959, E 20161.944 of\n\nthe RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nSERI KEMBANGAN INTERCHANGE\n\nMade 2 December 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/19; PN(PU2)460/LXXXIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H382"] = {"id":"MY-H382","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=487&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1967年工料测量师法","en":"QUANTITY SURVEYORS ACT 1967","orig":"QUANTITY SURVEYORS ACT 1967","vi":"Luật về Chuyên viên đo bóc khối lượng năm 1967","th":"พระราชบัญญัติผู้ประมาณราคาก่อสร้าง ค.ศ. 1967","id":"Undang-Undang Ahli Kuantitas Bangunan Tahun 1967","ms":"Akta Juruukur Bahan 1967"},"level":"law","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT487","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1967","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\1967_487_QUANTITY SURVEYORS ACT 1967.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H382-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) The following persons shall be disqualified from being appointed\nto or being members of the Board—\n(a) ‘a person who is of-unsound mind and/or is otherwise incapable\nof performing his duties;\n(6): a. bankrupt.     on\n(2) A member of the Board shall vacate his office if ‘he fails to\nattend three consecutive meetings of the Board without the permission\nin writing of the President or if he becomes disqualified under sub-\nparagraph (1)."}},{"id":"MY-H382-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. (1) The Board shall meet at least once a year at such place as may\nfrom time to time' be appointed by the President.\n(2) At any meeting of the Board the President shall preside, and\nin his absence the members shall elect one of their number to preside\nover the meeting.\n\nREGISTRATION OF SURVEYORS                1031\nox Ten\n\n(3) The quorum of the Board shall  cseven.\n\n(4) If on any question to be determined by the Board there is an\nequality of votes, the President or, in the case where the President is\nabsent, the member presiding over the mecting shall have a casting vote.\n\n(5) Subject to_sub-paragraphs (3) and (4) the Board shall determine\nits own procedurg\n\n(6) The Board shall cause proper records of its proceedings/to be\nkept.\n\n3, (1) The Board shall have a common seal which shall bear such\ndevice as the Board may approve and sich seal may from time to time\nbe broken, changed, altered and made anew by the Board as the Board\nmay think fit.\n\n(2) Until a seal is provided by the |Board under this paragraph, a\nstamp bearing the description \"Board of Surveyors\" may be used and\nshall be deemed to be the Common Sedl.\n\n(3) The Common Seal shall be kept! in the custody of the President\nand shall be authenticated by the President or other member acting in\nthe absence of the President, and any document purporting to be sealed\nwith the said seal, authenticated as aforesaid shall, until the contrary is\nshown, be deemed to have been validly executed."}},{"id":"MY-H382-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. All monies arising from fees payable| under this Act shall be paid to\nthe Board to be applied in the first place to defraying the expenses of\nregistration and other expenses of the administration of this Act includ-\ning any expenses of the Board that may be allowed under any rules\nmade under this Act and thereafter to|providing scholarships and the\npromotion of learning and education|in connection with, surveying.\nMonies not immediately required by the Board shall be invested in\nsuch Trustee Securities as the Board may from time to time determine.\n\n[Received the Royal Assent\non the 26th day of\nSeptember, 1967.)\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDI-CHETAK OLEH PENCHETAK KERAJAAN DAN DI-TERBITKAN DENGAN PERENTAH PADA\n30HB SEPTEMBER, 1967\n\nHarga: 50 sen\n\nAA\n\nx AA F42\n\nKandthe proceedings\n\nof any com\n\nappointed by\n\nDe tio.\n\nPEM fh\n\nig"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3820"] = {"id":"MY-H3820","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2016&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年关税税则（浮罗交怡）（修正）令","en":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (LANGKAWI) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","orig":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (LANGKAWI) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Duti Kastam (Langkawi) (Pindaan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế quan (Langkawi) (Sửa đổi) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งอากรศุลกากร (ลังกาวี) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Bea Masuk (Langkawi) (Perubahan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2016_P.U.(A)287-2016_CUSTOMS DUTIES (LANGKAWI) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3820-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Kastam (Langkawi)\n(Pindaan) 2016.\n\n     (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2016.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H3820-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Duti  Kastam (Langkawi) 1986 [ P.U. (A) 489/1986] dipinda dalam\nperenggan 2 dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dan ikan bilis\" dengan perkataan \",\nikan bilis, liquor yang memabukkan, produk tembakau dan rokok\".\n\nDibuat 31 Oktober 2016\n[SULITKE.HT(96)669/122Sk.1;Perb.CR(8.20)116/1138(2016)(SJ.8)(SK.1);PN(PU2)338]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 163B(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS DUTIES (LANGKAWI) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by  paragraph  163B(1)(a) of the\nCustoms   Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3821"] = {"id":"MY-H3821","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年医疗（附表二修正）（第5号）令","en":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018","orig":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) (Bilangan 5) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Y tế (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) (số 5) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการแพทย์ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) (ฉบับที่ 5) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Kedokteran (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) (Nomor 5) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)287-2018_MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3821-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua)\n\n(No. 5) 2018.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H3821-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Perubatan 1971 dipinda berhubung dengan negara\n\n\"Russia\", dengan menggantikan butiran \"I.M. Sechenov Moscow Medical Academy or\n\nMoscow Medical Academy (MMA) (official name is State Educational Establishment of\n\nHigher Vocational Training I.M. Sechenov Moscow Medical Academy)\" dan butir-butir\n\nyang berhubungan dengannya butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nNama Institusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"I.M. Sechenov Moscow Medical Academy atau\n\nMoscow Medical Academy (MMA) (official name is\n\nState Educational Establishment of Higher Vocational\n\nTraining I.M. Sechenov Moscow Medical Academy)—\n\n(a) yang didaftarkan sebagai State Educational\n\nInstitution of Highest Vocational Education\n\nMoscow Medical Academy dinamai\n\nbersempena dengan nama I.M. Sechenov of\n\nFederal Agency of Health and Social\n\nDevelopment pada 10 Mac 2005;\n\n(a) Doctor of\n\nMedicine in\n\nGeneral Medicine\n\n(sebelum 3 Mei\n\n2001, dikecualikan\n\ndaripada diiktiraf)\n\n(b) Doctor of Medicine\n\nin General\n\nMedicine MD\".\n\n(b) yang didaftarkan sebagai State Educational\n\nInstitution of Highest Vocational Education\n\nFirst Moscow State Medical University dinamai\n\nbersempena dengan nama I.M. Sechenov of\n\nMinistry of Health and Social Development of\n\nRussian Federation pada 19 Julai 2010;\n\n(c) yang didaftarkan sebagai State Budget\n\nEducational Institution of Highest Vocational\n\nEducation First Moscow State Medical\n\nUniversity dinamai bersempena dengan nama\n\nI.M. Sechenov of Ministry of Health and\n\nSocial Development of Russian Federation\n\npada 19 Julai 2011; dan\n\n(d) yang didaftarkan sebagai Federal State\n\nAutonomous Educational Institution of Higher\n\nEducation I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State\n\nMedical University of the Ministry of Health of\n\nthe Russian Federation atau Sechenov\n\nUniversity pada 11 Mei 2017.\n\nDibuat 24 Ogos 2018\n\n[KKM-60(20/2)/1/7; PN(PU2)97/VIII]\n\nDR. DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nMEDICAL ACT 1971\n\nMEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the\n\nMedical Act 1971 [Act 50], the Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3822"] = {"id":"MY-H3822","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第37号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 37) ORDER 2019","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 37) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 37) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 37) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 37) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 37) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)287-2019_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3822-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan\n(Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (No. 37) 2019.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H3822-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H3822-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel)  (No. 36) 2019 [P.U. (A) 280/2019] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 11 Oktober 2019 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 37) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\n                     Class of petrol and diesel\n\n Harga seliter/\n                               Price per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.68\n\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.08\n\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 18 Oktober 2019\nMade 18 October 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXV]\n\nDATUK MUEZ BIN ABD AZIZ\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 18 Oktober 2019\nApproved 18 October 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXV]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3823"] = {"id":"MY-H3823","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 287/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年货币（违法行为罚款了结）条例","en":"CURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"CURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Mata Wang (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Tiền tệ (Xử lý vi phạm bằng phạt tiền) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับเงินตรา (การระงับข้อหาด้วยค่าปรับ) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Mata Uang (Penyelesaian Pelanggaran dengan Denda) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA287","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2020_P.U.(A)287-2020_CURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3823-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nMata Wang (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2020.\n\nKesalahan yang boleh dikompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3823-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kesalahan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Pertama ditetapkan sebagai\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun.\n\n(2) Kesalahan yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) boleh dikompaun dengan\nkeizinan Pendakwa Raya dalam Borang MW 1 Jadual Kedua.\n\nTatacara mengkompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3823-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Apabila menerima apa -apa maklumat atau aduan bahawa suatu\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun telah dilakukan , Gabenor bo leh mengeluarkan suatu\ntawaran untuk mengkompaun kesalahan itu dalam Borang MW 2 Jadual Kedua.\n\n (2) Suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan adalah bagi tempoh\ntiga puluh hari atau apa -apa masa lanjutan sebagaimana yang diberikan oleh Gabenor\ndan jika pembayaran penuh bagi jumlah yang ditawarkan itu dibuat pada atau sebelum\nhabis tempoh tiga puluh hari atau apa -apa masa lanjutan sebagaimana yang diberikan\noleh Gabenor, tiada prosiding selanjutnya boleh diambil terhad ap orang yang telah\nmelakukan kesalahan itu.\n\nPenyetujuterimaan kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3823-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Seseorang yang menyetuju terima suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun hendaklah menyetuju terima tawaran itu dalam\nBorang MW 3 Jadual Kedua.\n\nPembayaran kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H3823-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Jika suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan disetuju terima\noleh orang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat, dia hendaklah membayar kompaun itu\ndengan mendepositkan bayaran kompaun ke dalam akaun yang dinyatakan  dalam\nBorang MW 2 Jadual Kedua melalui mana-mana bank berlesen di Malaysia.\n\n(2)  Selepas orang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat membayar  kompaun\ndi bawah subperaturan (1), dia hendaklah mengemukakan Borang MW 3  Jadual Kedua\nbersama-sama dengan bukti pembayaran kompaun itu kepada Gabenor.\n\n(3) Gabenor hendaklah mengeluarkan suatu resit rasmi untuk tiap -tiap\npembayaran yang dite rima di bawah subperaturan (1) kepada orang yang kepadanya\ntawaran untuk mengkompaun itu dibuat.\n\nPendakwaan boleh dimulakan jika tiada pembayaran dibuat"}},{"id":"MY-H3823-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Jika tiada pembayaran bagi kompaun yang ditawarkan itu dibuat dalam\nmasa yang dinyatakan dalam subperaturan 3(2), pendakwaan boleh dimulakan\ntanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n[Subperaturan 2(1)]\n\nKESALAHAN YANG BOLEH DIKOMPAUN\n\nKesalahan di bawah peruntukan Akta Mata Wang 2020 yang berikut ditetapkan sebagai\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun:\n\n(a) subseksyen 19(2)\n(b) subseksyen 20(3)\n(c) subseksyen 21(4)\n(d) subseksyen 24(2)\n(e) subseksyen 26(3)\n(f) subseksyen 36(4)\n(g) subseksyen 38(3)\n(h) subseksyen 41(4)\n(i) subseksyen 44(3)\n(j) subseksyen 45(2)\n(k) subseksyen 54(1)*\n\n*Nota: Kes alahan di bawah peruntukan  ini boleh dikompaun dengan syarat bahawa\nkesalahan yang dilakukan itu adalah berhubung dengan kesalah an yang dilakuk an\ndi bawah perenggan (a) hingga (j) Jadual ini.\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n[Subperaturan 2(2) dan 3(1), peraturan 4 dan subperaturan 5(1) dan 5(2)]\n\nBORANG MW 1\n[Subperaturan 2(2)]\nAKTA MATA WANG 2020\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN MATA WANG (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nKEIZINAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nPADA menjalankan kuasa yang diberikan oleh subseksyen 57(1)\nAkta Mata Wang 20 20 [Akta 827] dan subseksyen 376(3) Kanun Tatacara Jenayah\n[Akta 593 ], saya …….……………………………………………………………………………………………..\n(nama) dengan ini memberi kan keizinan untuk mengkompaun\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n(nama orang yang kepadanya tawaran kompaun itu dibuat ) bagi kesalahan yang\ndilakukan di bawah ………… …………………………………………………………………. yang dikatakan\ntelah dilakukan pada ………………………………………………… (tarikh) di …………………..……….…..\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………. (tempat).\n\n                   Tarikh:\n\n         .............................................................\n          Pendakwa Raya/\n            Timbalan Pendakwa Raya\n\nBORANG MW 2\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1) dan 5(1)]\n\nAKTA MATA WANG 2020\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN MATA WANG (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nTAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nApabila menjawab sila nyatakan:\nNombor rujukan: …………………………………............\nTarikh: ..……………………………………….……………….\n\nGabenor\nBank Negara Malaysia\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\nKepada:\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSuatu penyiasatan telah dijalankan terhadap anda/ ......….……………………………...………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n(nyatakan nama *syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain dan nombor pendaftaran, jika ada)\n\ndan anda didapati telah melakukan kesalahan di bawah Akta Mata Wang 20 20\n[Akta 827] dengan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(a) peruntukan Akta yang berkaitan: ......................................................................................................\n...........................................................................................................................................................................\n(b) tarikh: ............................................................................................................................................................\n\n(c) masa: ..............................................................................................................................................................\n(d) tempat: ..........................................................................................................................................................\n(e) butir-butir kesalahan: .............................................................................................................................\n ...........................................................................................................................................................................\n\n2. Menurut subseksyen 57(2) Akta Mata Wang 20 20, dengan keizinan Pendakwa\nRaya, anda ditawarkan suatu kompaun bagi kesalahan yang dinyatakan di atas\nbagi jumlah wang sebanyak RM ...................................................................................................................\n(………………………………………………………………. ringgit sahaja).\n\n3. Sekiranya tawaran kompaun  ini diterima, bayaran hendaklah dibu at dengan\nmendepositkan bayaran kompaun ke dalam akaun Akauntan Negara\n[nombor akaun: ……..………………………………………………………….] melalui mana-mana bank\nberlesen di Malaysia.\n\n4. Suatu resit rasmi akan dikeluarkan apabila Borang MW 3 dan bukti pembayaran\nkompaun itu diterima.\n\n5. Tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini adalah sah sehingga .........................................................\n\n6. Sekiranya tiada  bayaran diterima dalam masa yang disebut dalam perenggan 5,\npendakwaan bagi kesalahan itu boleh dimulakan terhadap anda tanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\nTarikh: ……………………………………………\n\n .................................................................................\n                                                                                                                                Gabenor\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nBORANG MW 3\n\n[Peraturan 4 dan subperaturan 5(2)]\n\nAKTA MATA WANG 2020\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN MATA WANG (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nPENYETUJUTERIMAAN TAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nKepada:\nGabenor\nBank Negara Malaysia\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSaya merujuk kepada Borang MW 2 dengan nombor rujukan ……………………………………….\nbertarikh ………………………………………….\n\n2. Saya menerima tawaran kompaun itu dan disertakan bukti pembayaran bagi\njumlah wang sebanyak RM ……………………………. (..............................................................................\nringgit sahaja) sebagai penyelesaian penuh bagi jumlah wan g yang dinyatakan dalam\nperenggan 2 Borang MW 2.\n\nTandatangan : ………………………………………………………………..……………….\nNama (huruf besar) : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nNombor kad pengenalan : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nJawatan (jika berkenaan) : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nUntuk dan bagi pihak\n(jika berkenaan)\n\n: ……………………………………………………………………….............\n             (nama* syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain)\n\nNombor pendaftaran syarikat\n(jika berkenaan)\n: ………………………………………………………………………………...\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nDibuat 28 September 2020\n[MOF(S)100-1/2/38(2); PN(PU2)295]\n\nDATO' SRI TENGKU ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nDiluluskan 28 September 2020\n[MOF(S)100-1/2/38(2); PN(PU2)295]\n\nTAN SRI IDRUS BIN HARUN\nPendakwa Raya Malaysia\n\nCap rasmi *syarikat/perniagaan/\nbadan lain (jika berkenaan)\n: ………………………………………………………………………………...\n\nAlamat : ………………………………………………………………………………...\n  ………………………………………………………………………………...\n  ………………………………………………………………………………...\nTarikh : .………………………………………………………………………………..\n\nCURRENCY ACT 2020\n\nCURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 57(1) of  the\nCurrency Act 20 20 [Act 827], the Minister, on the recommendation of the Bank,\nwith the approval of the Public Prosecutor, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation\n1.  These regulations may be cited as the  Currency ( Compounding of  Offences)\nRegulations 2020.\n\nOffences which may be compounded\n2. (1) The offences specified in the First Schedule are  prescribed as offences\nwhich may be compounded.\n\n(2) The offences referred to in subregulation (1) may be compounded with\nthe consent of the Public Prosecutor in Form MW 1 of the Second Schedule.\n\nProcedure for compounding\n3. (1) Upon receipt of any information or complaint that an offence which may\nbe compounded has been committed, the Governor may issue an offer to compound the\noffence in Form MW 2 of the Second Schedule.\n\n(2) An offer to compound an offence is for a period of thirty days or such\nextended time as the Governor may grant and if full payment of the sum offered is made\non or before the expiry  of thirty days or such extended time as the Governor may grant,\nno further proceedings shall be taken against the person who committed such offence.\n\nAcceptance of compound\n4. A person who accepts an offer to compound an offence which may be\ncompounded shall accept the offer in Form MW 3 of the Second Schedule.\n\nPayment of compound\n5. (1) If an offer to compound an offence is accepted by the person to whom the\noffer is made, he shall pay the compound  by depositing the payment of compound into\nthe account specified in Form MW 2  of the Second Schedule  through any licensed bank\nin Malaysia.\n\n (2) After the person to whom the offer is made  paid the compound  under\nsubregulation (1) , he  shall submit Form MW 3 of the Second Schedule together with\nthe proof of payment of compound to the Governor.\n\n (3) The Governor shall issue an official receipt  for every payment received\nunder subregulation (1) to the person to whom the offer to compound is made.\n\nProsecution may be instituted if no payment made\n6. If no payment of the compound offered is made within the time specified\nin subregulation 3(2), prosecution may be instituted without further notice.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 2(1)]\n\nOFFENCES WHICH MAY BE COMPOUNDED\n\nThe o ffences under the following provisions of the Currency Act 2020 are prescribed\nto be offences which may be compounded:\n\n(a) subsection 19(2)\n(b) subsection 20(3)\n(c) subsection 21(4)\n(d) subsection 24(2)\n(e) subsection 26(3)\n(f) subsection 36(4)\n(g) subsection 38(3)\n(h) subsection 41(4)\n(i) subsection 44(3)\n(j) subsection 45(2)\n(k) subsection 54(1)*\n\n*Note: The offence under this provision  may be compounded  provided that the offence\ncommitted is in relation to the offe nce committed under paragraphs (a) to (j) of\nthis Schedule.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n[Subregulations 2(2) and 3(1), regulation 4 and subregulations 5(1) and 5(2)]\n\nFORM MW 1\n[Subregulation 2(2)]\nCURRENCY ACT 2020\nCURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nCONSENT TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nIN exercise of the po wers conferred by subsection 57 (1) of the\nCurrency Act 2020  [Act 827 ] and subsection 376(3) of the Crimin al Procedure Code\n[Act 593], I …………….……………………………………………………………………………………….. (name)\ngive consent to compound ………………… ………………………………………………………………………..\n(name of the person to whom the  compound offer is made)  for the *offence/offences\ncommitted under ………………………………………………………………. w hich *is/are said to have\nbeen committed on …………………………………………… (date) at …………..……………………………..\n………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………. (place).\n\n  Date:\n\n         ............................................................\n                    Public Prosecutor/\n             Deputy Public Prosecutor\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nFORM MW 2\n[Subregulations 3(1) and 5(1)]\nCURRENCY ACT 2020\nCURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nOFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nIn reply please quote:\nReference number: ...……………………………….........\nDate: .……………………………………….………………......\n\nThe Governor\nCentral Bank of Malaysia\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\nTo:\n…………………………………………………………………... ...\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nAn investigation has been conducted against you/………………………………………………………..\n………………………………………………………..……………………………………………………………..…………..\n(state name of *company/business/other body and the registration number, if any)\n\nand you are found to have committed the offence under the Currency Act 2020 [Act 827]\nwith the following particulars:\n\n(a) relevant provision of the Act: ………………………………………………………………………..…….\n …………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..……....\n(b) date: …………………………………………………………………………………………..………………………\n(c) time: ……………………………………………………………………………………………………………….....\n\n(d) place: ……………………………………………………………………………….……………………………...…\n(e) particulars of offence: …………………………………………………………………………………….......\n …………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..……....\n\n2.  Pursuant to subsection 57(2) of the Currency Act 20 20, with the consent of\nthe Public Prosecutor, you are offered a compound for the offence stated  above for the\nsum of RM …………………………..………..………………………..……………………………………………………\n(………………………………………………………………. ringgit only).\n\n3.  If this offer to compound is accepted, payment shall be made by depositing\nthe payment of compound into the account of the Accountant General\n[account number: ……..………………………………………………………….]  through any licensed\nbank in Malaysia.\n\n4.  An official receipt shall be issued on the receipt of Form MW 3 and the proof of\npayment of compound.\n\n5.  This offer to compound shall be valid until ...................................................................................\n\n6.  If no payment is received within the time referred to in paragraph 5,\nprosecution for the offence may be instituted against you without further notice.\n\nDate: ……………………………………………\n\n .................................................................................\n                                      Governor\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nFORM MW 3\n[Regulation 4 and subregulation 5(2)]\nCURRENCY ACT 2020\nCURRENCY (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nACCEPTANCE OF OFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nTo:\nThe Governor\nCentral Bank of Malaysia\n…………………………………………………………………......\n…………………………………………………………………......\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nI refer to Form MW 2 bearing the reference number  …………………………………………. dated\n………………………………………….\n\n2. I accept the offer t o compound and enclose d is the proof of payment  for\nthe sum of RM …………………………………………. (.................................................................................\nringgit only) as full settlement of the sum stipulated in paragraph 2 of Form MW 2.\n\nSignature : ………………………………………………………………..……………….\nName (in capital letter) : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nIdentity card number : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nDesignation (if applicable) : ………………………………………………………………………………...\nFor and on behalf (if applicable)\n\n: ………………………………………………………………………………...\n           (name of *company/business/other body)\nCompany registration number\n(if applicable)\n: ………………………………………………………………………………...\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nMade 28 September 2020\n[MOF(S)100-1/2/38(2); PN(PU2)295]\n\nDATO' SRI TENGKU ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance\n\nApproved September 2020\n[MOF(S)100-1/2/38(2); PN(PU2)295]\n\nTAN SRI IDRUS BIN HARUN\nPublic Prosecutor of Malaysia\n\nOfficial stamp\n*company/business/other\nbody (if applicable)\n: ………………………………………………………………………………...\n\nAddress : ………………………………………………………………………………...\n  ………………………………………………………………………………...\n  ………………………………………………………………………………...\nDate: : .……………………………………………………………………………….."}}],"pack":"my-9"};
