  FT["MY-H3878"] = {"id":"MY-H3878","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年食品（修正）条例","en":"FOOD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","orig":"FOOD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","ms":"Peraturan Makanan (Pindaan) 2013","vi":"Quy định về Thực phẩm (Sửa đổi) năm 2013","th":"ข้อบังคับอาหาร (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Peraturan Pangan (Perubahan) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2013_P.U.(A)290-2013_FOOD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3878-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nMakanan (Pindaan) 2013.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Oktober 2013.\n\nPindaan peraturan 396"}},{"id":"MY-H3878-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Makanan 1985 [P.U. (A) 437/1985] dipinda dengan\n\nmemotong peraturan 396.\n\nDibuat 28 Ogos 2013\n\n[K.K.M-163/S/27; PN (PU2)418/XX]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nFOOD ACT 1983\n\nFOOD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 34 of the Food Act 1983 [Act 281],\n\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3879"] = {"id":"MY-H3879","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年战略贸易（解除禁止最终用户相关财产冻结）条例","en":"STRATEGIC TRADE (UNFREEZING OF PROPERTY IN RELATION TO PROHIBITED END-USERS) REGULATIONS 2014","orig":"STRATEGIC TRADE (UNFREEZING OF PROPERTY IN RELATION TO PROHIBITED END-USERS) REGULATIONS 2014","ms":"Peraturan Perdagangan Strategik (Penyahbekuan Harta Berkaitan Pengguna Akhir Larangan) 2014","vi":"Quy định về Thương mại chiến lược (Giải tỏa phong tỏa tài sản liên quan đến người sử dụng cuối bị cấm) năm 2014","th":"ข้อบังคับการค้ายุทธศาสตร์ (การปลดอายัดทรัพย์สินเกี่ยวกับผู้ใช้ปลายทางต้องห้าม) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Peraturan Perdagangan Strategis (Pencairan Pembekuan Properti Terkait Pengguna Akhir Terlarang) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2014_P.U.(A)290-2014_STRATEGIC TRADE (UNFREEZING OF PROPERTY IN RELATION TO PROHIBITED END-USERS) REGULATIONS 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3879-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini b olehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nPerdagangan Strategik (Pencairan Harta berhubung dengan Pengguna Akhir\nTerlarang) 2014.\n\n(2)  Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 November 2014.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H3879-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini—\n\n \"harta\" ertin ya harta yang telah dibekukan menurut langkah yang diambil\nberhubung dengan orang yang ditetapkan di bawah perenggan 3(1) (a)\nPeraturan-Peraturan Perdagangan Strategik  (Resolusi Majlis Keselamatan Pertubuhan\nBangsa-Bangsa Bersatu) 2010 [P.U. (A) 481/2010];\n\n \"orang yang ditetapkan\" ertinya mana -mana individu atau entiti yang di tetapkan\nsebagai pengguna akhir terlarang di bawah seksyen 8 Akt a dan disenaraikan dalam\nJadual Kedua kepada Perintah Perdagangan Strategik (Pengguna Akhir Terh ad dan\nPengguna Akhir Terlarang) 2010 [P.U. (A) 484/2010];\n\n \"pemohon\" ertinya seseorang yang membuat suatu permohonan bagi pencairan\nhartanya di bawah peraturan 3.\n\nPermohonan bagi pencairan harta"}},{"id":"MY-H3879-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3.  (1) Seseorang yang secara tidak sengaja terjejas dengan pembekuan hartanya\natas sebab dia mempunyai nama yang sama atau serupa dengan orang yang ditetapkan\nboleh mengemukakan suatu permohonan kepada Pengawal bagi pencairan harta itu.\n\n (2)  Permohonan di bawah subperaturan (1) hendaklah—\n\n(a) dalam bentuk yang ditentukan oleh Pengawal;\n\n(b) mengandungi butiran mengenai pemohon dan harta pemohon, dan\nmaklumat terperinci mengenai pembekuan harta itu; dan\n\n(c) disokong dengan dokumen yang berkaitan  sebagaimana yang\ndifikirkan perlu oleh Pengawal.\n\n(3)  Pengawal boleh , pada bila -bila masa selepas menerima permohonan\ndi bawah subperaturan (1), menghendaki pem ohon untuk menyediakan apa-apa\ndokumen atau maklumat tambahan dalam tempoh yang dinyatakan oleh Pengawal.\n\n (4)  Jika dokumen atau maklumat tambah an yang dikehendaki di bawah\nsubperaturan (3) tidak d isediakan oleh pemohon dalam tempoh yang dinyatakan atau\napa-apa tempoh lanjutan yang di berikan oleh Pengawal, permohonan itu hendaklah\ndisifatkan telah ditarik balik dan hendaklah tidak boleh lagi diter uskan, tanpa\nmenjejaskan permohonan baru yang dikemukakan oleh pemohon.\n\n(5)  Pengawal boleh, setelah menimbangkan permohonan di bawah\nsubperaturan (1) dan   apa-apa dokumen atau maklumat tambahan di bawah\nsubperaturan (3), jika ada, membenarkan atau enggan  membenarkan pencairan harta\npemohon.\n\n(6)  Keputusan Pengawal untuk membenarkan atau enggan membenarkan\npencairan harta pemohon di bawah subperaturan (5) hendaklah disampaikan kepada\npemohon.\n\n(7) Jika Pengawal membenarkan pencairan harta pemohon di bawah\nsubperaturan (5) , kebenaran itu hendaklah disampaikan kepada pihak berkuasa yang\nberkenaan dan pihak berkuasa yang berkenaan hendaklah memaklumkan institusi yang\nberkaitan di bawah pengawalseliaan dan pengawasannya untuk mencairkan harta\npemohon.\n\n (8) Bagi maksu d peraturan ini, \"pihak berkuasa yang berkenaan\" ertinya\nmana-mana Kementerian atau agensi kerajaan yang terlibat dalam pembekuan harta\npemohon.\n\nRundingan dan kerjasama"}},{"id":"MY-H3879-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Bagi maksud Peraturan-Peraturan ini, Pengawal boleh berunding  atau\nbekerjasama dengan mana-mana Kementerian atau agensi kerajaan sebagaimana yang\ndifikirkan sesuai oleh Pengawal.\n\nDibuat 3 November 2014\n[MITI/STS/(S)/443; PN(PU2)628/V]\n\nDATO' SRI MUSTAPA BIN MOHAMED\nMenteri Perdagangan Antarabangsa dan Industri\n\nSTRATEGIC TRADE ACT 2010\n\nSTRATEGIC TRADE (UNFREEZING OF PROPERTY IN RELATION TO PROHIBITED\nEND-USERS) REGULATIONS 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 55(1) of the Strategic Trade Act 2010\n[Act 708], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H388"] = {"id":"MY-H388","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=494&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":23,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1961年赛马（赛马投注管理局）法","en":"RACING (TOTALIZATOR BOARD) ACT 1961","orig":"RACING (TOTALIZATOR BOARD) ACT 1961","vi":"Luật về Đua ngựa (Cục Cá cược Tổng hợp) năm 1961","th":"พระราชบัญญัติการแข่งม้า (คณะกรรมการการพนันม้า) ค.ศ. 1961","id":"Undang-Undang Pacuan Kuda (Dewan Totalisator) Tahun 1961","ms":"Akta Lumba Kuda (Lembaga Totalisator) 1961"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT494","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1961","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 29 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1961_494_RACING (TOTALIZATOR BOARD) ACT 1961.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H388-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Racing (Totalisator\nBoard) Act, 1961, and shall come into operation on such\ndate as the Minister may by notification in the Gazette\nappoint.          |                cL RP-3-6/~ AM 9Ifoy"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—\n\n\"approved scheme\" means a scheme for the establishment\nand operation of totalisators and totalisator agencies for the\ntime being approved by the|Minister pursuant to section 16;\n\n\"the Board\" means the Totalisator Board established by\nsection 3;\n\n\"horse race\" includes a pony race;\n\n\"Minister\" means the Minister for the time being charged\nwith responsibility for the Board;\n\n\"race course\" means any|land used for the purpose of a\nrace meeting;\n\n\"race meeting\" means a\nracing;\n\n\"Senior Police Officer\" means any police officer not below\nthe rank of Assistant Superintendent, and includes any other\npublic officer authorised by, the Minister by notification in\nthe Gazette to exercise the powers of a Senior Police Officer\nunder this Act;\n\n\"totalisator\" means the instrument for wagering or bet-\nting known by that name, and any other instrument, device,\nmachine or method of a like nature and conducted on the\nsame principles, and includes a numbers forecast totalisator\npaying a fixed minimum diyidend;\n\neeting for the purpose of horse\n\nShort title\nand com-\nmencement.\n\nInterpreta-\ntion.\n\n32                        10 oF 1961\n\n\"totalisator agency\" means any totalisator agency\noperated in accordance with an approved scheme, and\nincludes any premises in which totalisator investments may\nbe received pursuant to such scheme;\n\n\"totalisator investment\"|means any money, currency note\nor cheque received for investment on the totalisator or\ninvested pursuant to any facilities provided under an\napproved scheme;\n\n\"turf club\" means any club, association or other body of\npersons (whether incorporated or unincorporated) estab-\nlished for the purpose of promoting, conducting and\ncontrolling the sport of horse racing.\n\nes I\nTHE TOTALISATOR BOARD\n\nEstablish- 3, (1) There is hereby established a Board, which shall be\n\nment and\n\nincorpora- & body corporate, by the name of the Totalisator Board.\npad. -    (2) The Board shall have perpetual succession and a\n\ncommon seal and may sue and be sued in its said name\nand, subject to and for the| purposes of this Act, may enter\ninto contracts and acquire,| purchase, take, hold and enjoy\nmovable and immovable property of every description and\nmay convey, assign, surrender, yield up, charge, mortgage,\ndemise, reassign, transfer or otherwise dispose of or deal\nwith any movable or immovable property or any interest\ntherein vested in the Board upon such terms as the Board\nmay think fit.\n\nPowersof 4, The Board shall, subject to the provisions of this Act,\nie Board. have the following powers\n\n(a) the powers specified in any approved scheme;\n\n(b) power to conduct eqnpine research and to establish,\nmaintain and improve turf clubs, training centres for\napprentices, jockeys, blacksmiths and others\nemployed in connection with racing, and other\nplaces used in \"3 with racing;\n\n(c) power to carry on all other activities which appear to\nthe Board requisite, advantageous or convenient for\nor in connection with the objects of this Act and\ntheir powers thereunder and for the improvement of\nracing generally in the Federation.\n\nConstitution 5. (1) The Board shall consist of the following members,\n\nBoard      appointed by the Minister\n\n(a) two members who shall be appointed upon the\nnomination of the governing body of the Selangor\nTurf Club;                 |\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                      33\n\n(b) two members who shall be appointed upon the\nnomination of the goyerning body of the Perak Turf\nClub;\n\n(c) two members who shall be appointed upon the\nnomination of the governing body of the Penang\nTurf Club;\n\n(d) members appointed pursuant to any order made\nunder sub-section (3);\n\n(e) two other members.\n\n(2) If at any time any of the bodies referred to in sub-\nsection (1) fails to submit to|the Minister a nomination of\na person or persons for the purposes of this section within\ntwenty-eight days after the feceipt of a request in writing\nfrom the Minister in that behalf the Minister may without\nsuch nomination appoint any person or persons to be a\nmember or members of the Board, and the person or persons\nso appointed shall for all purposes be deemed to be duly\nappointed.\n\n(3) In the event of there being established in the\nFederation any turf club additional to any of the turf clubs\nreferred to in sub-section (1) the Yang di-Pertuan Agong\nmay by order provide for representation of such club upon\nthe Board; and the provision' of sub-section (2) shall there-\nupon apply to the governing body of every such club.\n\n(4) The Minister of Finance may from time to time\nappoint a public officer to take part in the proceedings of\nthe Board and any committee thereof, but such officer shall\nnot have any vote in any such proceedings."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. (1) The members of the, Board shall, subject to the\nprovisions of this Part, be appointed to hold office for such\nterm, not exceeding tree | years, as the Minister shall\ndetermine upon making the appointment.\n\n(2) A member of the |Board shall be eligible for\nre-appointment.\n\n(3) If any member of the|Board—\n\n(a) is absent without the permission of the Board\nfrom four consecutive meetings of the Board;\nor\n\n(b) becomes bankrupt or compounds with his\ncreditors; or\n\n(c) is convicted of any offence by a court of law in\nthe Federation and sentenced to imprison-\nment for a term of not less than one year, and\nhas not received a free pardon; or\n\nTenure of\noffice.\n\nChairman.\n\n34                    10 oF 1961\n\n(d) becomes insane; | Or\n\n(e) accepts or holds|any office of profit under the\nBoard or is directly or indirectly concerned in\nany contract with the Board or participates\nin or derives on is entitled to any benefit either\ndirectly or indirectly from any work done or\nto be done for|or goods supplied to or to be\nsupplied to the|Board; or\n\n(f) resigns; or\n\n(g) dies; or\n\n(h) in the case of any member nominated by any of\nthe bodies referred to in sub-section (1) of\nsection 5, cease$ to be a nominee of such body,\n\nhis seat shall thereupon become vacant, and every such\nvacancy shall be deemed to| be an extraordinary vacancy.\n\n(4) On the occurrence of any vacancy in the office of a\nmember of the Board a person shall be appointed pursuant\nto the provisions of this Part to fill the vacancy; and any\nperson appointed to fill an| extraordinary vacancy shall,\nsubject to the provisions of| this Part, hold office for the\nremainder of the term of office of the person in whose place\nhe is appointed."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. (1) The Chairman of the} Board shall be appointed by\nthe Minister from among the members of the Board and\nshall hold office for such period, not exceeding three years,\nas the Minister may direct.\n\n(2) The Chairman shall vacate his office as chairman if\nhe ceases to be a member of the Board.\n\n(3) Any vacancy occurring in the office of chairman,\notherwise than by effluxion of the period for which he was\nappointed, shall be filled by (the appointment of a member\nof the Board for the balance of the term of office of the\nperson in whose place he i appointed.\n\n(4) A person ceasing to be chairman of the Board shall\n\nbe eligible for Sa as chairman.\n(5) At any meeting of the Board—\n(a) held during any vacancy in the office of\nchairman; or {\n\n(b) at which the chairman is not present,\n\na person elected for that purpose from the members by the\nmembers present at the meeting shall act as chairman of\nthe meeting and may exercise the powers conferred on the\n\nchairman.                              |\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                                35"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. (1) The quorum of the Board shall be five members.\n\n(2) All questions at meetings of the Board shall be\ndetennined by a majority of the members personally present\nand voting; each member present shall be entitled to cast\none vote, and in the event of an equality of votes the\nmember presiding shall have a second or casting vote.\n\n(3) Members of the Board shall not be entitled to any\nremuneration but may be paid by the Board allowances in\nrespect of such matters and at such rates as may from time\nto time be fixed by the Board with the approval of the\nMinister.\n\n(4) The Board may invite any person to attend meetings\nof the Board and to take part|in proceedings of the Board,\nbut such person shall not be entitled to cast a vote in such\nproceedings."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. (1) The Board may point such officers, agents and\nemployees as it deems necessary for the efficient carrying\nout of its functions under this Act.\n\n(2) Except in accordance with and subject to the provi-\nsions of an approved scheme, the Board shall not make or\nagree to make to any officer, agent or employee of the Board\nany payment by way of commission, fee, reward or other\nremuneration which is calculated or determined or affected\nby reference, directly or indirectly, to the amount of any\ntotalisator investment received by the Board or by that\nofficer, agent or employee on behalf of the Board.\n\n(3) The provisions of sub- sections (1) and (2) of section\n26 of the Civil Law Ordinance, 1956 (which relate to agree-\nments by way of gaming and wagering) shall not be deemed\nto apply to any contract or agreement between the Board\nand any officer, agent or employee of the Board."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. (1) Any contract which, if made between private\npersons—\n(a) must be by deed shall, when made by the Board, be\nin writing under the common seal of the Board;\n(b) must be in writing signed by the parties to be charged\ntherewith shall, when made by the Board, be either\nin writing under the seal of the Board or in writing\nsigned by any person acting on behalf and under the\nexpress or implied authority of the Board;\n(c) may be made orally may, in the case of any contract\n(other than a contract involving the payment by the\nBoard of any sum in excess of two hundred and fifty\ndollars) be similarly made by any person acting on\nbehalf of and under the express or implied authority\nof the Board.       |\n\nProcedure,\netc., of the\nBoard.\n\nOfficers,\nagents, etc.,\nof the\nBoard.\n\n5 of 1956.\n\nContracts\nof the\nBoard.\n\nFinancial\nduties of the\nBoard.\n\nBorrowing\npowers of\nthe Board.\n\nAudit.\n\nRules of\nthe Board.\n\n36                       10 oF 1961\n\n(2) Notwithstanding janything in sub-section (1), no\ncontract made by or on behalf of the Board shall be invalid\nby reason only that it was| not made in the manner provided\nby this section, if it was made pursuant to or to give effect\nto a resolution of the Board.\n\n(3) Nothing in this section shall be construed to limit\nthe powers of the Board |with respect to the acceptance or\nreceipt of totalisator investments in accordance with an\napproved scheme and any rules or regulations under this\nAct."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"en":"11. The Board shall caus¢ proper books and accounts to be\nprovided and true and regular records to be entered therein\nof all transactions of the Board, and such books and\naccounts shall be open| at all reasonable times to the\ninspection of such public officers as the Minister of Finance\nmay from time to time appoint."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"en":"12. With the approval off the Minister and of the Minister\nof Finance the Board may borrow moneys, whether by way\nof mortgage, charge, overdraft or otherwise, and may charge\nall or any of its movable or immovable property, whether\npresent or future, in such manner as it thinks fit."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"en":"13. (1) The Board shall appoint one or more auditors who\nshall, throughout the year, inspect and examine the accounts\nof the Board.\n\n(2) The appointment of any person as auditor under\nsub-section (1) shall require the prior approval of the\nMinister of Finance.\n\n(3) An auditor appointed under this section shall on\n\nor before the thirtieth day of June in each year submit to\nthe Board and to the Minister of Finance an annual report\non the accounts of the Board in respect of the preceding\nyear, and shall in his report draw attention to all cases in\nwhich it shall appear to him that the provisions of this Act\nor of any approved scheme or regulations or rules made\nthereunder have not been complied with.\n\n14, The Board may from time to time make rules, not\nInconsistent with the proyisions of this Act or any approved\nscheme or regulations made thereunder, for all or any of\nthe following purposes\n\n(a) regulating its own |procedure and the conduct of its\nmeetings;\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                    37\n\n(b) providing for the custody of its property and the use\nof its common sea];\n\n(c) prescribing the duties of its officers, agents and\nemployees;\n\n(d) with the approval Hi the Minister, controlling the\nadmission of persons to any totalisator and\ntotalisator agency, and providing for the exclusion\nfrom any such agency of any specified class or\ndescription of persons, either absolutely or subject\nto such conditions jas may be prescribed;\n\n(e) such other purposes} as the Board may consider\nnecessary or expedient for the operation of any\napproved scheme or for carrying out the functions\nof the Board."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15"},"text":{"en":"15. The Board shall, as soon as practicable after the end of\neach year, cause to be-made and transmitted to the Minister\na report dealing generally with the activities of the Board\nduring the preceding year, and containing such information\nrelating to the finances and policy of the Board as the\nMinister may from time to/time direct.\n\nPART II\nTOTALISATORS AND TOTALISATOR AGENCIES"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16"},"chapter":{"en":"PART II"},"text":{"en":"16. (1) The Board shall, not|later than a day to be appointed\nin that behalf by the Minister by notice in writing addressed\nto the chairman of the Board, submit to the Minister for\nhis approval a scheme for the establishment and operation\nof totalisators and totalisator agencies in respect of race\nmeetings.                 |\n\n(2) Any scheme prep\nprovide for—\n\n(a) the administration of |the scheme, and for the estab-\nlishment, maintenance and operation of totalisators\nand totalisator agencies and for the carrying out\nof the functions of the Board under the scheme;\n\n(b) the receiving at totalisators and totalisator agencies\nof totalisator investments in respect of horse races,\nthe credit facilities in respect of such investments,\nthe manner in which such investments may be made\nand the times at which and the conditions upon or\nsubject to which such investments may be made and\nreceived;\n\n(c) the transmission or nat, as the case may be, of parti-\nculars of the investments referred to in paragraph (b)\n\nted under this section may\n\nReport of\nthe Board.\n\nApproval of\ntotalisator\nagency\nscheme.\n\n38               10 oF 1961\n\nof this sub-section to the totalisator on the race\ncourse where the race meeting is being held, and for\nfailure of such transmission;\n\n(d) the payment at or from totalisators and totalisator\nagencies of dividends payable in respect of\ntotalisator investments received and the times at\nwhich and the manner in which such dividends may\nbe paid;\n\n(e) the method of calculation of the dividends payable as\naforesaid out of |moneys received as totalisator\ninvestments;\n\n(f) the method of accounting as between the Board, turf\nclubs and totalisator agencies in respect of invest-\n\nments, dividends and commission;\n\n(g) such other matters as may be necessary for the proper\noperations and control of totalisators and totalisator\n\nagencies, or for the operation of the scheme.\n\n(3) The Board may from time to time submit to the\nMinister for his approval |any variation of any scheme or\nany part thereof for the time being in force under this\n\nsection, or any new scheme in substitution for any such\nscheme as aforesaid.\n\n(4) No scheme or any/part thereof, and no variation of\nany such scheme or part thereof, shall come into force until\napproved in writing by the Minister.\n\n(5) Every approved scheme and any variation thereof\nshall be published in the| Gazette.\n\n(6) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may by order notified\nin the Gazette suspend or revoke any approved scheme or\nvariation of an approved scheme, or any part thereof, and\nany such suspension or revocation shall have the effect of\na Tepeal of such scheme or part, as the case may be.\n\nCalculation 17. (1) Except as may be provided under any approved\n\nof dividend. scheme it shall be the duty of the Board and of any turf\nclub operating a totalisator on behalf of the Board under\nan approved scheme to pay out by way of dividend all\nmoneys received from inyestments on the totalisator after\ndeducting—\n\n(a) the amount of any \\duty charged under section 2 of\n\n6 of 1948,              the Betting and Sweepstake Duties Ordinance, 1948;\nand\n\n(b) by way of commission ten per centum, or such other\namount (whether greater or lesser than ten per\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                        39\n\ncentum) as may be prescribed by any regulations\nmade under section 29, of all such moneys:\nProvided that—\n\n(i) it shall not be necessary to pay out fractions of a\ndollar;\n\n(ii) any investment on any horse which is scratched or\notherwise withdrawn in accordance with the rules\nof racing applied by any approved scheme shall be\nrefunded without |deduction of such duty and\ncommission;\n\n(iii) the total of such duty and commission shall not at\nany time exceed |twenty per centum of such\ninvestment.\n\n(2) No money received by the Board pursuant to any\napproved scheme through any turf club in the State of\nSingapore referred to in any declaration under section 18\nfor investment on horse races in the Federation shall be\nliable for duty or commission|in accordance with sub-section\n(1) above."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"chapter":{"en":"PART II"},"text":{"en":"18. (1) Where the Minister is satisfied—\n\n(a) that the members and officers of any turf club in the\nState of Singapore are exempted generally from the\nprovision of any lay relating to common gaming\nhouses for the time being in force in that State; and\n\n(b) that the Board is willing to receive in accordance with\nan approved scheme totalisator investments from\nany such club for inyestment on horse races in the\nFederation; and\n\n(c) that suitable arrangements have been or are being\nmade in the State of} Singapore in order to exempt\nfrom the provisions jof any law relating to betting\nand sweepstake duties for the time being in force in\nthat State any investments made by or on behalf of\nthe Board with any club referred to in paragraph (a)\non horse races in the|State of Singapore,\n\nhe may by notification in |the Gazette declare that the\nprovisions of this section shall apply to any money received\nby the Board from or through the agency of any such club\nfor investment on horse races in the Federation.\n\n(2) Where any declaration under sub-section (1) is in\nforce all moneys received by the Board from or through the\nagency of any club specified jin such notification for invest-\nment on horse races in the Federation shall be exempt from\nthe provisions of paragraphs (a) and (b) of sub-section (1)\nof section 17, and of section 2 of the Betting and Sweepstake\nDuties Ordinance, 1948.   |\n\nSpecial\n\nprovisions\nrelating to\nSingapore.\n\n6 of 1948.\n\nProportion\nof deduction\nfrom invest-\nment to\nbelong to\nthe Board.\n\nDistribution\nof funds of\nthe Board.\n\nAdmission\ntorace\ncourses.\n\n25 of 1953.\n\n40                     10 oF 1961"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A19","no":19,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 19"},"chapter":{"en":"PART II"},"text":{"en":"19. (1) The sum deducted by way of commission in accord-\nance with paragraph (b) af sub-section (1) of section WA\ntogether with any fractional money arising pursuant to the\noperation of paragraph (i) of the proviso to sub-section (1)\nof section 17 shall be deemed for all purposes to belong to\nand form part of the general funds of the Board and may\nbe apportioned between the Board and the turf clubs in\nsuch proportion and in such manner as may be approved\nby the Minister under an approved scheme.\n\n(2) The sum apportioned to and retained by the Board\nby way of commission and fractional money pursuant to\nthe provisions of sub-section (1) shall not be liable to\nincome tax."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"chapter":{"en":"PART II"},"text":{"en":"20. Subject to any regulations made under section 29, the\nBoard may from time to time distribute any moneys form-\ning part of the funds of the Board and not required by it\nin the exercise of its powers under section 4 for all or any\nof the following purposes\n\n(a) social and welfare purposes including the welfare of\nthe blind, handicapped and under-privileged, the\nrelief of poverty, the treatment of tuberculosis and\nthe fostering of non-political youth movements; and\n\n(b) the promotion of sport generally in the Federation\nincluding the provisjon of playing fields.\n\nPart ILI\nMISCELLANEOUS"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"21. (1) A turf club may admit members of the public to\nany race course or premises junder the control or supervision\nof the club or of any one or more of the officers of such\nclub on payment of an admission fee.\n\n(2) Where an admission fee is charged under sub-\nsection (1), such admission fee shall be subject to the pay-\nment of duty under the Entertainments Duty Ordinance,\n\n(3) A turf club may from time to time, with the\napproval of the Minister, make by-laws controlling the\nadmission of persons to any race course or premises used\nor occupied by such club for race meetings or for the\nplacing of investments on the totalisator.\n\n(4) Any by-laws made under this section may provide\nfor the exclusion from a race course or such premises of\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                   41\n\nany specified class or description of persons, either absolutely\nor subject to such conditions as may be prescribed by such\nby-laws.\n\n(5) The provisions of this section—\n\n(a) shall be applicable to any race course notwith-\nstanding the fact that it is or forms part of a\nreserve or other place in respect of which\nthere exists 4 right of public use or entry;\n\n(b) shall not be deemed to limit the power of any\nclub to exclude or remove any person from\nany race course occupied by such club and\nwhich is free from such right of public use of\nentry.\n\n(6) Any person who commits a breach of any by-law\nmade under this section may be removed from the race\ncourse by any member, officer, agent or employee of the\npu club by which such by-law was made, or by any police\nofficer.\n\n(7) All by-laws made |under this' section shall be\npublished in the Gazette, and the cost of such publication\nshall be borne by the turf club by which the by-laws were\nmade."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A22","no":22,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 22"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"22. (1) Notwithstanding the|provisions of any other law to\nthe contrary it shall be lawfhl for—\n\n(a) totalisator investments|in respect of horse races to be\nlodged and received, |and for dividends to be paid in\nrespect of such investments, in accordance with an\napproved scheme;\n\n(b) any person of or above the age of eighteen years to\nbuy a ticket or chance or take part in any totalisator\noperated in accordamce with an approved scheme,\nDanang that| he is not a member of a turf\nclub.\n\n(2) Where any totalisator is operated in accordance\nwith an approved scheme no person shall be liable in respect\nof the use of such totalisator to any penalty or forfeiture\nunder the Common Gaming Houses Ordinance, 1953, or\nthe Betting Ordinance, 1953, lor any law for the time being\nin force relating to gaming, betting or lotteries."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A23","no":23,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 23"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"23. (1) Notwithstanding anything contained in any written\nlaw, it shall not be an offence for any person—\n\n(a) to exhibit the name of any totalisator agency on any\npremises in which the agency is situated,\n\nAuthority of\ntotalisator\noperations\nand invest-\nments in\naccordance\nwith\napproved\nscheme.\n\n26 of 1953.\n47 of 1953.\n\nCertain\nadvertise-\nments\nrelating to\ntotalisator\nagencies not\nunlawful.\n\n4?                  10 oF 196]\n\n(b) to publish in any newspaper, by or on behalf of the\nBoard, any advertis¢ment setting out any list of\ntotalisator agencies, the name, address, hours of\nbusiness and any |telephone number of any\ntotalisator agency, any rules, terms or conditions\nupon or subject to which totalisator investments\nmay be received at any such agency, or the name of\nany race meeting in respect of which totalisator\ninvestments may for|the time being be received at\nany such agency;\n\n(c) to exhibit inside any |totalisator agency any notice\nrelating to any of|the matters referred to in\nparagraph (b) of this|sub-section.\n\n(2) Nothing in sub-section (1) shall be construed to\nauthorise the exhibition or publication of any matter\nintended to induce any person to make any totalisator\ninvestment.\n\nLaying of 24. (1) Any person who—\n\notalisator\n\nodds, etc.        (a) makes or enters into a bet upon the result of a horse\n\npronibilen           race, whereby he agrees to pay to the other party\nto the said bet, if the latter should win the bet, a\nsum of money the amount of which is dependent\nupon the result of the working of the totalisator on\n\nthe said race; or\n\n(b) sells or offers for sale, or who purchases from any\nperson referred to i paragraph (a), any ticket, card\nor thing entitling {or purporting to entitle the\npurchaser or holder thereof to any interest in the\nresult of the working of the totalisator on any\nhorse race; or\n\n(c) makes any contract or bargain of any kind to pay\nor receive money upon an event determined or to\nbe determined by the result of the working of the\ntotalisator on any Horse race,\n\nshall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction\nto imprisonment for a term fot exceeding three months or\nto a fine not exceeding five hundred dollars, or to both such\nimprisonment and fine.\n\n(2) The provisions of paragraphs (a) and (b) of sub-\nsection (1) shall not apply to|the Board or any officer, agent\nor employee of the Board or|any turf club while engaged in\nthe lawful conduct of any totalisator or totalisator agency\nin accordance with an a scheme.\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                    43"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A25","no":25,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 25"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"25. Subject to the provisions of any approved scheme and\nany regulations made under section 29, any member, officer,\nagent or employee of the Board or of any turf club who—\n\n(a) receives or permits to|be received any investment on\nthe totalisator in respect of any race after the start\nof such race; or\n\n(b) registers on the totalisator after the start of any race\nany moneys received for investment in respect of\nthat race; or\n\n(c) takes into account in|the calculation or payment of\nany dividend any investment which has not been\npublicly registered on the totalisator in accordance\nwith this section; o\n\n(d) receives or permits to| be received any investment on\nthe totalisator elsewhere than at the totalisator itself;\nor\n\n(e) makes, authorises or| permits the payment to any\nperson of any dividend which is not calculated in\naccordance with pepe of section 17,\n\nshall be guilty of an offence and liable on conviction to a\nfine not exceeding one thousand dollars."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A26","no":26,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 26"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"26. Any police officer not below the rank of Inspector may\narrest without warrant any person whom he has reason to\nbelieve has committed an offence against section 24 or 25,\nand take him before a Magistrate to be dealt with accord-\ning to law."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A27","no":27,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 27"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"27. A Senior Police Officer) may at any time enter for the\npurpose of inspection any premises in which any totalisator\nor totalisator agency is operated, and may during such\ninspection examine any books, accounts, records or other\ndocuments, or any machine or equipment, for the time being\nused in the operation of the totalisator or agency, and seize\nany such books, accounts, records, documents, machine or\nequipment which he has reasonable cause to believe to be\nevidence of the commission] of any offence against this Act,\nand may demand from any person for the time being having\nthe care and management jof the totalisator or agency or\nany part thereof any information that he deems necessary\nfor the purpose of the inspection.\n\nInvestment\non totalisa-\ntor after\ntime of race\nprohibited.\n\nPower of\narrest.\n\nInspection\nof totalisa-\ntors and\ntotalisator\nagencies.\n\nRestriction\n\non prosccu-\n\ntion.\n\nPower to\nmake |\nregulations\n\ndd                  10 oF 1961"}},{"id":"MY-H388-A28","no":28,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 28"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"28. A prosecution for any, offence against section 25 shal]\nnot be instituted except by or with the consent of the\nPublic Prosecutor."}},{"id":"MY-H388-A29","no":29,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 29"},"chapter":{"en":"Part ILI"},"text":{"en":"29. The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may from time to time\nmake such regulations as|he may consider necessary or\nexpedient to give effect to| the provisions of this Act and\nfor the due administration |thereof.\n\n[Received the Royal Assent\non the 9th day of March,\n1961.J\n\nSection\nli\n\n25:\n\nRACING (TOTALISATOR BOARD)                   45\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS\n\nShort title and commencement.\nInterpretation.\n\nPART I\n\nTHE TOTALISATOR BOARD\nEstablishment and incorporation of the Board.\nPowers of the Board.\n\nConstitution of the Board.\nTenure of office.\n\nChairman.\n\nProcedure, etc. of the Board.\nOfficers, agents, etc. of the Board.\nContracts of the Board.\nFinancial duties of the Board.\nBorrowing powers of the Board.\nAudit.\n\nRules of the Board.\n\nReport of the Board.\n\nPART II\n\nTOTALISATORS AND TOTALISATOR AGENCIES\nApproval of totalisator agency scheme.\nCalculation of dividend.\n\nSpecial provisions relating to Singapore.\n\nProportion of deduction from investment to belong to the\nBoard.\n\nDistribution of funds of the Board.\n\nPart III\n\nMISCELLANEOUS\nAdmission to race courses.\n\nAuthority of totalisator operations and investments in accord-\nance with approved scheme.\n\nCertain advertisements relating to totalisator agencies not\nunlawful.\n\nLaying of totalisator odds, etc. prohibited.\n\nInvestment on totalisator after time of race prohibited.\nPower of arrest.\n\nInspection of totalisators and totalisator agencies.\nRestriction on prosecution.\n\nPower to make regulations.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\n\nPRINTED BY THE GOVERNMENT PRINTER AND PUBLISHED BY AUTHORITY ON 23RD MARCH, 1961\n\nPrice: 50 cts."}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3880"] = {"id":"MY-H3880","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年商品与服务税（零税率供应）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"GOODS AND SERVICES TAX (ZERO-RATED SUPPLY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"GOODS AND SERVICES TAX (ZERO-RATED SUPPLY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Cukai Barang dan Perkhidmatan (Bekalan Kadar Sifar) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế hàng hóa và dịch vụ (Cung ứng chịu thuế suất 0%) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสินค้าและบริการ (การจัดหาที่อัตราศูนย์) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Pajak Barang dan Jasa (Penyerahan Tarif Nol) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)290-2015_GOODS AND SERVICES TAX (ZERO-RATED SUPPLY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3880-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Barang dan\n\nPerkhidmatan (Pembekalan Berkadar Sifar) (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2016.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H3880-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Barang dan Perkhidmatan (Pembekalan Berkadar Sifar) 2014\n\n[P.U. (A) 272/2014], yang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam\n\nJadual Pertama—\n\n(a) dalam butiran 2, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dan gas perubatan\"\n\ndengan perkataan \", gas perubatan dan peranti perubatan\";\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 2 butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"2A. Ubat di bawah Senarai Racun Kumpulan A, B, C dan D di bawah\n\nAkta Racun 1952 [Akta 366] yang didaftarkan di bawah akhiran A oleh\n\nPihak Berkuasa Kawalan Dadah, Biro Pengawalan Farmasiutikal\n\nKebangsaan, Kementerian Kesihatan dan dalam sukatan dos atau\n\nbentuk bungkusan untuk jualan runcit.\"; dan\n\n(c) dalam Lampiran—\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan selepas kod tarif 03.08 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 04.02 Milk and cream, concentrated or\n\ncontaining added sugar or other\n\nsweetening matter.\n\n0402.10 000 - In powder, granules or other solid\n\nforms, of a fat content, by weight, not\n\nexceeding 1.5% (in powder form for\n\ninfants and young children use only)\n\n- In powder, granules or other solid\n\nforms, of a fat content, by weight,\n\nexceeding 1.5% (in powder form for\n\ninfants and young children use only)\n\n0402.21 000 - - Not containing added sugar or other\n\nsweetening matter (in powder form\n\nfor infants and young children use\n\nonly)\n\n0402.29 000- - - Other (in powder form for infants\n\nand young children use only) \";\n\n(ii) dengan menggantikan kod tarif 07.13 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya dengan kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 07.13 Dried leguminous vegetables, shelled,\n\nwhether or not skinned or split.\n\n0713.20 000 - Chickpeas (garbanzos) (split and\n\nskinned only)\n\n- Beans (Vigna spp., Phaselous spp.):\n\n0713.31 000 - - Beans of the species Vigna mungo\n\n(L.) Hepper or Vigna radiate (L.)\n\nWilczek (split and skinned only)\n\n0713.40 000 - Lentils (split and skinned only)\n\n0713.60 000 - Pigeon peas (Cajanus cajan) (split and\n\nskinned only) \";\n\n(iii) dengan menggantikan kod tarif 07.14 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya dengan kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 07.14 Manioc, arrowroot, salep, Jerussalem\n\nartichokes, sweet potatoes and similar\n\nroots and tubers with high starch or\n\ninulin content, fresh, chilled, frozen or\n\ndried, whether or not sliced or in the\n\nform of pellets; sago pith.\n\n0714.10 - Manioc (cassava):\n\n900 - - Other\n\n0714.20 000 - Sweet potatoes\n\n0714.30 000 - Yams (Diocorea spp.)\n\n0714.90 - Other:\n\n900 - - Other (lotus root and water\n\nchestnut (fresh only) \";\n\n(iv) dengan memasukkan selepas kod tarif 11.06 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 12.07 Other oil seeds and oleaginous fruits,\n\nwhether or not broken.\n\n1207.50 000 - Mustard seeds \";\n\n(v) dengan menggantikan kod tarif 17.01 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya dengan kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 17.01 Cane or beet sugar and chemically pure\n\nsucrose, in solid form.\n\n- Raw sugar not containing flavouring\n\nor colouring matter:\n\n1701.13 000 - - Cane sugar specified in Subheading\n\nNote 2 to this Chapter (Jaggery\n\nPowder)\n\n1701.14 000 - - Other cane sugar (Jaggery Powder)\n\n1701.99 000 - Other:\n\n- - Other (cane sugar only) \";\n\n(vi) dengan menggantikan kod tarif 19.02 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya dengan kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n(vii) dengan memasukkan selepas kod tarif 21.03 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya kod tarif dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya yang berikut:\n\n\" 19.02 Pasta, whether or not cooked or stuffed\n\n(with meat or other substances) or\n\notherwise prepared, such as spaghetti,\n\nmacaroni, noodles, lasagna, gnocchi,\n\nravioli, cannelloni; couscous, whether\n\nor not prepared.\n\n- Uncooked pasta, not stuffed or otherwise\n\nprepared:\n\n1902.19 - - Other:\n\n200 - - - Rice vermicelli (bee hoon)\n\n400 - - - Noodles (wet mi kuning and dry mi\n\nkolok only)\n\n900 - - - Other (laksa and kue tiaw only)\n\n1902.30 - Other pasta:\n\n500 - - Rice vermicelli (bee hoon)\n\n900 - - Other (laksa and kue tiaw only) \";\n\n\" 21.06 Food preparations not elsewhere\n\nspecified or included.\n\n2106.90 - Other:\n\n- - Other:\n\n910 - - - For infants and young children\n\nuse (used as milk substitute in\n\npowder form prepared from\n\nplant suitable for feeding infants\n\nand young children which\n\ncomply with the requirements\n\nspecified in the\n\nFood Regulations 1985\n\n[P.U. (A) 437/1985] and put\n\nup in forms of packaging for\n\nretail sale only)\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H3880-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Kedua—\n\n(a) dalam butiran 23—\n\n(i) dalam subbutiran (1), dengan memotong perkataan \"pelancongan\n\ndalam negeri atau\"; dan\n\n(ii) dengan menggantikan subbutiran (2) dengan subbutiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(2) \"Pelancongan ke luar negeri\" mempunyai erti yang\n\ndiberikan kepadanya di bawah seksyen 2 Akta Industri\n\nPelancongan 1992 [Akta 482].\";\n\n(b) dalam butiran 25, dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"di bawah\"\n\nperkataan \"Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013 [Akta 758], Akta\n\nPerkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013 [Akta 759] atau\"; dan\n\n\".\n\n(c) dengan menggantikan butiran 27 dengan butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"27. Pembekalan perkhidmatan dalam talian bagi—\n\n(a) jurnal;\n\n(b) surat khabar di bawah kod tarif 4902.10.000 dan\n\n4902.90.000 sebagaimana yang disenaraikan dalam\n\nLampiran kepada Perintah ini; dan\n\n(c) bahan bacaan di bawah kod tarif 4905.91.000 dan\n\n4911.99.300 sebagaimana yang disenaraikan dalam\n\nLampiran kepada Perintah ini.\".\n\nDibuat 11 Disember 2015\n\n[SULIT. KE. HF(152)860/01–2(66); Perb.R0.3865/356/1JLD.16(SK.5); PN(PU2)721/VI]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 17(5) Akta Cukai Barang\n\ndan Perkhidmatan 2014]\n\nGOODS AND SERVICES TAX ACT 2014\n\nGOODS AND SERVICES TAX (ZERO-RATED SUPPLY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2)\n\nORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 17 of the Goods and Services Tax\n\nAct 2014 [Act 762], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3881"] = {"id":"MY-H3881","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2016&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年地方限速（联邦道路）（西马来西亚）（修正）令","en":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","orig":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ địa phương (Đường bộ liên bang) (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วท้องถิ่น (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Lokal (Jalan Raya Federal) (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2016_P.U.(A)290-2016_LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3881-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) 2016.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 10 November 2016.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H3881-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) 1992\n\n[P.U. (A) 462/1991] dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala\n\n\"NEGERI TERENGGANU\" dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 43 butiran yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nNama jalan dan lokasi\n\n(2)\n\nHad laju\n\n(km/j)\n\n\"44. Laluan 3 – Jalan Kuala Terengganu/Kota Bharu\n\nKg. Petaling U 5.347617, T 103.04664 sehingga\n\nKg. Bukit Guntung U 5.353942, T 103.057496\n\n(jarak sepanjang 1.40 km)\n\n70\".\n\nDibuat 4 November 2016\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/8/1 jld. 6 (19); PN(PU2)460/LXXXVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nLOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT)\n\nORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3882"] = {"id":"MY-H3882","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2018&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年贷款担保（法人团体）（税与印花税免除）（第5号）（2018年）（修正）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 5) 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 5) 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Bilangan 5) (Tahun 2018) (Pindaan) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh Khoản vay (Tổ chức pháp nhân) (Miễn thuế và thuế trước bạ) (Số 5) (năm 2018) (Sửa đổi) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันสินเชื่อ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (ฉบับที่ 5) (ค.ศ. 2018) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Penjaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Nomor 5) (Tahun 2018) (Perubahan) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)290-2018_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 5) 2018 (AMENDMENT) O.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3882-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremit an Cukai dan Duti Setem) (No. 5 ) 2018\n(Pindaan) 2018.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 19 Oktober 2018.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H3882-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai\ndan Duti Setem) (No. 5) 2018 [P.U. (A) 266/2018] dipinda dalam perenggan 2—\n\n(a) dengan menomborkan semula perenggan itu sebagai subperenggan 2(1);\n\n(b) dalam subperenggan (1) sebagaimana yang dinomborkan semula, dalam\nsubsubperenggan (b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"subperenggan\"\ndengan perkataan \"subsubperenggan\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (1) subperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\" (2) Sebutan tentang Program Nota Jangka Sederhana Islamik dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik  dalam subsubperenggan (1) (a) adalah sebutan\ntentang Program Nota Jangka Sederhana Islamik dan  Kertas Komersial\nIslamik yang telah ditambah nilai nominal daripada empat puluh\nenam bilion ringgit (RM46,000,000,000.00) kepada nilai agregat maksimum\nsehingga enam puluh satu billion ringgit (RM61,000,000,000.00).\".\n\nDibuat 8 November 2018\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/8; PN(PU2)232/XIV]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE)\n(REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 5) 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1)  of the\nLoans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96 ], the Minister makes t he\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3883"] = {"id":"MY-H3883","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年联邦直辖区（规划）（购买地方规划变更草案的费用）规则","en":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (FEE FOR PURCHASE OF DRAFT PROPOSAL FOR ALTERATION OF LOCAL PLAN) RULES 2019","orig":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (FEE FOR PURCHASE OF DRAFT PROPOSAL FOR ALTERATION OF LOCAL PLAN) RULES 2019","vi":"Quy tắc về Lãnh thổ Liên bang (Quy hoạch) (Phí mua dự thảo đề xuất thay đổi quy hoạch địa phương) năm 2019","th":"กฎเขตการปกครองสหพันธ์ (การผังเมือง) (ค่าธรรมเนียมการซื้อร่างข้อเสนอการเปลี่ยนแปลงผังเมืองท้องถิ่น) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Tata Tertib Wilayah Persekutuan (Penataan Ruang) (Biaya Pembelian Rancangan Usulan Perubahan Rencana Lokal) Tahun 2019","ms":"Kaedah Wilayah Persekutuan (Perancangan) (Fi Pembelian Draf Cadangan Pindaan Rancangan Tempatan) 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)290-2019_FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (FEE FOR PURCHASE OF DRAFT PROPOSAL FOR ALTERATION OF LOCAL PLAN).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3883-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah (Perancangan)\n\nWilayah Persekutuan (Fi bagi Pembelian Draf Cadangan bagi Perubahan Pelan\n\nTempatan) 2019.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2019.\n\nFi"}},{"id":"MY-H3883-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Fi bagi pembelian salinan draf cadangan perubahan Pelan Bandar Raya\n\nKuala Lumpur 2020 ialah RM100.00.\n\nDibuat 29 Oktober 2019\n\n[DBKL/JUP/BPPP/GN/808 JLD. 3; PN(PU2)396/VII]\n\n DATO' NOR HISHAM BIN A DAHLAN\n\n Datuk Bandar Kuala Lumpur\n\nDiluluskan 29 Oktober 2019\n\n[KWP(S):24/PUU/698/1/1/94 ; PN(PU2)396/VII]\n\n HAJI KHALID BIN ABD. SAMAD\n\n Menteri Wilayah Persekutuan\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) ACT 1982\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (FEE FOR PURCHASE OF DRAFT PROPOSAL FOR\n\nALTERATION OF LOCAL PLAN) RULES 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 17 and paragraph 64(2)(j)\n\nof the Federal Territory (Planning) Act 1982 [Act 267], the Commissioner of the City of\n\nKuala Lumpur, with the approval of the Minister, makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3884"] = {"id":"MY-H3884","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2020&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":13,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年消防服务（消防证书）（修正）条例","en":"FIRE SERVICES (FIRE CERTIFICATE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"FIRE SERVICES (FIRE CERTIFICATE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Perkhidmatan Bomba (Sijil Bomba) (Pindaan) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Dịch vụ cứu hỏa (Giấy chứng nhận phòng cháy chữa cháy) (Sửa đổi) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับบริการดับเพลิง (หนังสือรับรองการดับเพลิง) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Dinas Pemadam Kebakaran (Sertifikat Kebakaran) (Perubahan) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 13 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）；已清除正文中的 1 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2020_P.U.(A)290-2020_FIRE SERVICES (FIRE CERTIFICATE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3884-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Nama pemohon (pemunya/penghuni/orang yang mempunyai pengurusan\n\nsepenuhnya ke atas premis ditetapkan):\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..."}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Alamat surat-menyurat: …………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..."}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Nombor kad pengenalan: ………………………………………………………………………………………."}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Nombor telefon: …………………………………………………………………………………………"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Alamat e-mel: ……………………………………………………………………………………………..."}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Nama pemunya terbaru premis ditetapkan:\n\n……….……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..\n\n(sila sertakan salinan yang disahkan)"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Nombor pendaftaran perniagaan: ……………………………………………………………………….….\n\nDaerah: …………………………………….… Negeri: ………………………………………………………"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Tarikh kelulusan dan nombor rujukan pelan yang diluluskan bagi premis\n\nditetapkan:\n\n (a) Nombor rujukan Pihak Berkuasa Tempatan: …………..….………………………………….\n\n Tarikh kelulusan: .…………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n (b) Nombor rujukan Jabatan Bomba dan Penyelamat: …………………………………………\n\n Tarikh kelulusan: ............................................................................................................................."}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Organisasi keselamatan kebakaran\n\n(a) No. Pendaftaran: …………………………………………………….……….\n\n(sila sertakan sesalinan perakuan penubuhan organisasi keselamatan\n\nkebakaran itu)\n\n (b) Pengurus keselamatan kebakaran (ADA / TIADA)\n\n Nama: ………………………………………………………………………………\n\n No. Pendaftaran: ……………………………………………………………….\n\n (sila sertakan salinan yang disahkan)\n\n(c) Pegawai keselamatan kebakaran (Lampiran) ……………. orang"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10. Sesalinan Pelan Tindakan Kebakaran dan Kecemasan (ADA / TIADA)"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11. Sesalinan Laporan Keselamatan Kebakaran (ADA / TIADA)\n\nPENTING\n\nButir-butir mengenai tarikh pemasangan, kelulusan sistem oleh Jabatan Bomba dan\n\nPenyelamat bersama-sama maklumat tentang kontraktor perlu dikemukakan.\n\nSaya/Kami memperaku bahawa sepanjang pengetahuan saya/kami, segala keterangan\n\nyang diberikan di dalam borang permohonan ini adalah benar dan betul.\n\nTarikh: ........................................\n\nTandatangan pemohon: ………………………………………..\n\n(Cap rasmi)\n\nLampiran\n\nSenarai Pegawai Keselamatan Kebakaran\n\nNama Premis Ditetapkan: ……………………………………………………………………………………\n\nBil. Nama No. Pendaftaran Tarikh Pendaftaran\n\n\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual B"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"ms":"12. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual B dengan jadual\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEDUA\n\nBORANG\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1)]\n\nPERAKUAN BOMBA\n\nDengan ini diperakui bahawa premis ditetapkan ini\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\ntelah mematuhi kehendak yang berhubungan dengan kelengkapan bagi\n\nmenentang kebakaran atau pepasangan keselamatan kebakaran mengikut\n\nAkta Perkhidmatan Bomba 1988.\n\nDengan ini diperakui juga bahawa suatu organisasi keselamatan kebakaran telah\n\nditubuhkan dan suatu Pelan Tindakan Kebakaran dan Kecemasan dan Laporan\n\nKeselamatan Kebakaran telah disediakan, berkenaan dengan premis ditetapkan\n\nmengikut Akta Perkhidmatan Bomba 1988.\n\nPerakuan ini sah dari ……………………………... hingga ………………………….……………….\n\n ………………………………………………\n\n Ketua Pengarah\n\n Jabatan Bomba dan Penyelamat\".\n\nJadual Ketiga, Jadual Keempat, Jadual Kelima dan Jadual Keenam baharu"}},{"id":"MY-H3884-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"ms":"13. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas Jadual Kedua\n\nsebagaimana dipinda jadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KETIGA\n\nBORANG\n\n[Perenggan 4(2)(a)]\n\nPERMOHONAN BAGI PEMBAHARUAN PERAKUAN BOMBA\n\nPengarah,\n\nJabatan Bomba dan Penyelamat,\n\nNegeri ………………………………….....\n\nSaya/Kami ................................................................................................................................................... ingin\n\nmemohon untuk pembaharuan perakuan bomba bagi premis ditetapkan yang berikut:\n\n(Nyatakan alamat penuh premis ditetapkan)\n\n…………………………………………………………………………………………..........................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n2. Nombor rujukan: …………………………………………….\n\n *3. Saya/Kami dengan ini mengakui bahawa tidak terdapat perubahan ketara pada\n\npremis ditetapkan itu dan dengan itu maklumat yang diberikan dalam Jadual Pertama\n\npermohonan saya/kami berkenaan dengan premis ditetapkan itu bertarikh\n\n………………………………. masih terpakai.\n\n*4. Saya/Kami dengan ini mengakui bahawa terdapat perubahan ketara pada\n\npremis ditetapkan itu, dengan itu saya/kami mengemukakan semula Bahagian II Jadual\n\nPertama permohonan saya/kami berkenaan dengan premis ditetapkan itu (Sila isikan\n\nBahagian II Jadual Pertama).\n\n*5. Saya/Kami dengan ini mengakui bahawa terdapat perubahan ketara pada\n\npremis ditetapkan itu, dengan itu saya/kami mengemukakan semula Jadual Pertama\n\npermohonan saya/kami berkenaan dengan premis ditetapkan itu.\n\n6. Saya/Kami mengemukakan Laporan Keselamatan Kebakaran yang terbaru.\n\n7. Saya/Kami mengemukakan Pelan Tindakan Kebakaran dan Kecemasan yang\n\nterbaru (jika berkaitan).\n\nTarikh: ........................................\n\nTandatangan pemohon: ................................................\n\n(Cap rasmi)\n\n* Potong jika tidak berkenaan\n\nJADUAL KEEMPAT\n\nBORANG\n\n[Subperaturan 6C(1)]\n\nPERMOHONAN BAGI PENUBUHAN ORGANISASI KESELAMATAN KEBAKARAN\n\nKetua Pengarah,\n\nJabatan Bomba dan Penyelamat\n\nSaya/Kami..............................................................................................................................................................\n\n(Nama pemohon (pemunya/penghuni/orang yang mempunyai pengurusan sepenuhnya\n\nke atas premis ditetapkan). Nombor kad pengenalan: ……………………………………………….\n\ningin memohon bagi penubuhan organisasi keselamatan kebakaran berkenaan dengan\n\npremis ditetapkan yang berikut: (Nyatakan nama dan alamat penuh premis ditetapkan)\n\n………………………………………………………………………………………….………………………………………..\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n2. Pengurus keselamatan kebakaran\n\nNama: ……………………………………………………………………….\n\nNo. Pendaftaran: ………………………………………………………….\n\n (sila sertakan salinan yang disahkan)\n\n3. Pegawai keselamatan kebakaran (Lampiran) ……………. orang\n\nSaya/Kami memperaku bahawa sepanjang pengetahuan saya/kami segala keterangan\n\nyang diberikan dalam borang permohonan ini adalah benar dan betul.\n\nTarikh: ........................................\n\nTandatangan pemohon: ………………………………………..\n\n(Cap rasmi)\n\nLampiran\n\nSenarai Pegawai Keselamatan Kebakaran\n\nNama Premis Ditetapkan: ……………………………………………………………………………………\n\nBil. Nama No. Pendaftaran Tarikh Pendaftaran\n\nJADUAL KELIMA\n\n[Subperaturan 6C(3)]\n\nPERAKUAN PENUBUHAN ORGANISASI KESELAMATAN KEBAKARAN\n\nNo. Pendaftaran: ........................................\n\nDengan ini diperakui bahawa premis ini\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\ntelah menubuhkan suatu organisasi keselamatan kebakaran di premis ditetapkan\n\nsebagaimana yang dikehendaki di bawah seksyen 27A Akta Perkhidmatan Bomba 1988.\n\n ................................................................\n\n Ketua Pengarah\n\n Jabatan Bomba dan Penyelamat\n\nJADUAL KEENAM\n\n[Subperaturan 3(3) dan 4(3)]\n\nFI BAGI PERAKUAN BOMBA DAN PERAKUAN BOMBA YANG DIPERBAHARUI\n\nPremis Ditetapkan\n\nMengikut Kegunaan\n\nFi\n\nPerakuan Bomba\n\n(RM)\n\nPerakuan Bomba\n\nyang Diperbaharui\n\n(RM)\n\n1. Perpustakaan 300.00 150.00\n\n2. Hospital dan rumah rawatan 400.00 200.00\n\n3. Hotel 500.00 250.00\n\n4. Asrama dan dormitori 300.00 150.00\n\n5. Pejabat 400.00 200.00\n\n6. Kedai 500.00 250.00\n\n7. Kilang 1,000.00 500.00\n\n8. Tempat perhimpunan 300.00 150.00\n\n9. Penstoran dan premis lain 500.00 250.00\n\nNOTA:\n\nJika mana-mana premis yang ditetapkan digunakan bagi lebih daripada satu tujuan, fi\n\nyang kena dibayar hendaklah fi yang paling tinggi yang ditetapkan bagi tujuan itu.\".\n\nKecualian dan peralihan\n\n14. (1) Mana-mana permohonan bagi perakuan bomba yang dibuat di bawah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ibu sebelum tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini\n\ndan belum selesai di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu hendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan\n\nkuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini, diuruskan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\n\nseolah-olah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu tidak dipinda oleh Peraturan-Peraturan ini.\n\n(2) Mana-mana permohonan bagi pembaharuan perakuan bomba yang\n\ndibuat di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu sebelum tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini dan belum selesai di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\n\nhendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini, diuruskan di\n\nbawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu seolah-olah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu tidak dipinda oleh\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini.\n\n(3) Mana-mana perakuan bomba yang dikeluarkan di bawah PeraturanPeraturan ibu sebelum tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini\n\nhendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini, disifatkan telah\n\ndikeluarkan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu sebagaimana yang dipinda oleh\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini dan hendaklah terus sah sehingga dibatalkan atau\n\ntamat tempoh.\n\n(4) Mana-mana pemunya, penghuni atau orang yang mempunyai pengurusan\n\nsepenuhnya ke atas premis ditetapkan yang, sebaik sebelum tarikh permulaan kuat\n\nkuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini, telah dikeluarkan kepadanya suatu perakuan bomba\n\nbagi premis ditetapkan itu di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu hendaklah, dalam masa\n\ndua belas bulan dari tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini, memohon\n\nuntuk menubuhkan suatu organisasi keselamatan kebakaran berkenaan dengan premis\n\nditetapkan itu mengikut Peraturan-Peraturan ibu sebagaimana yang dipinda oleh\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini.\n\nDibuat 28 September 2020\n\n[KPKT/PUU(R)/8/11 Jld.2; PN(PU2)471/VI]\n\n HAJAH ZURAIDA BINTI KAMARUDDIN\n\n Menteri Perumahan dan Kerajaan Tempatan\n\nFIRE SERVICES ACT 1988\n\nFIRE SERVICES (FIRE CERTIFICATE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 62 of the Fire Services Act 1988\n\n[Act 341], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Fire Services (Fire Certificate)\n\n(Amendment) Regulations 2020.\n\nAmendment of regulation 1A\n\n2. The Fire Services (Fire Certificate) Regulations 2001 [P.U. (A) 241/2001],\n\nwhich are referred to as the \"principal Regulations\" in these Regulations, are amended\n\nin regulation 1A by inserting after the definition of \"subdivided building\" the following\n\ndefinition:\n\n ‘ \"fire safety organization\" means an organization established under\n\nregulation 6B;\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 2\n\n3. Regulation 2 of the principal Regulations is amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for subregulation (1) the following subregulation:\n\n \"(1) An application for a fire certificate in respect of\n\na designated premises shall be made in the form in the\n\nFirst Schedule and shall be accompanied by—\n\n(a) a certificate of establishment of a fire safety\n\norganization issued under regulation 6C;\n\n(b) a copy of a Fire and Emergency Response Plan; and\n\n(c) a copy of a Fire Safety Report,\n\nin respect of the designated premises.\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after subregulation (1) the following subregulation:\n\n\"(1A) The Fire and Emergency Response Plan and\n\nFire Safety Report referred to in paragraphs (1)(b) and (c)\n\nrespectively shall be prepared by the fire safety organization in\n\nrespect of the designated premises in the form and manner as may\n\nbe determined by the Director General.\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 2A\n\n4. Regulation 2A of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for the\n\nwords \"these Regulations\" the words \"subsection 29(2) of the Act\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 3\n\n5. Regulation 3 of the principal Regulations is amended—\n\n(a) in subregulation (1), by substituting for the words \"in Form II of Schedule\n\nA\" the words \"in the form in the Second Schedule\";\n\n(b) in subregulation (3), by substituting for the words \"in Schedule B\" the\n\nwords \"in the Sixth Schedule\"; and\n\n(c) in subregulation (5), by inserting after the words \"an offence\" the words\n\n\"and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand\n\nringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 4\n\n6. Regulation 4 of the principal Regulations is amended—\n\n(a) in subregulation (1)─\n\n(i) by deleting the first proviso; and\n\n(ii) in the further proviso, by deleting the word \"further\";\n\n(b) in subregulation (2)—\n\n(i) in paragraph (a), by substituting for the words \"in Form III of\n\nSchedule A\" the words \"in the form in the Third Schedule\";\n\n(ii) in paragraph (b), by substituting for the word \"premises\" the\n\nwords \"designated premises\"; and\n\n(iii) by substituting for paragraph (c) the following paragraph:\n\n \"(c) furnish a copy of a Fire Safety Report; and\"; and\n\n(c) in subregulation (3), by substituting for the words \"in Schedule B\" the\n\nwords \"in the Sixth Schedule\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 6\n\n7. Subregulation 6(1) of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for\n\nthe word \"premises\" wherever appearing the words \"designated premises\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 6A\n\n8. Regulation 6A of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for the\n\nword \"premises\" wherever appearing the words \"designated premises\".\n\nNew regulations 6B, 6C, 6D and 6E\n\n9. The principal Regulations are amended by inserting after regulation 6A the\n\nfollowing regulations:\n\n\"Establishment of fire safety organization in respect of\n\ndesignated premises\n\n6B. (1) Any owner, occupier or person having the overall management of a\n\ndesignated premises shall, on an application made under regulation 6C, establish\n\na fire safety organization in respect of the designated premises.\n\n(2) The fire safety organization shall consist of one fire safety\n\nmanager and at least three fire safety officers appointed by the owner, occupier\n\nor person having the overall management of the designated premises.\n\n(3) The fire safety manager and fire safety officers appointed under\n\nsubregulation (2) shall be certified by the Director General in a manner\n\ndetermined by the Director General.\n\nApplication for establishment of fire safety organization\n\n6C. (1) An application for the establishment of a fire safety organization\n\nunder regulation 6B shall be made by the owner, occupier or person having the\n\noverall management of the designated premises to the Director General in the\n\nform in the Fourth Schedule upon the appointment of the fire safety manager\n\nand fire safety officers.\n\n(2) Upon receipt of an application under subregulation (1), the\n\nDirector General may approve the application and issue a certificate of the\n\nestablishment of the fire safety organization, with or without condition, or refuse\n\nthe application.\n\n(3) The certificate of the establishment of a fire safety organization\n\nissued under subregulation (2) shall be in the form in the Fifth Schedule.\n\n(4) The Director General may cancel the certificate of the\n\nestablishment of the fire safety organization issued under subregulation (2) if\n\nthe fire safety organization fails to comply with any condition imposed by the\n\nDirector General in respect of the certificate.\n\nDuties of owner, occupier or person having the overall management of\n\ndesignated premises\n\n6D. (1) The owner, occupier or person having the overall management of\n\nthe designated premises to whom the certificate of establishment of a fire safety\n\norganization is issued under regulation 6C shall—\n\n(a) provide the fire safety organization with fire-fighting\n\nequipment or fire safety installation;\n\n(b) provide information relating to fire safety and emergency to\n\nthe fire safety organization;\n\n(c) notify the Director General in writing of any change in the\n\nappointment of the fire safety manager or fire safety\n\nofficers within fourteen days from the date of the\n\noccurrence of such change; and\n\n(d) appoint a new fire safety manager or fire safety officer,\n\nwithin thirty days from the date of resignation or\n\ntermination of any fire safety manager or fire safety officer,\n\nas the case may be.\n\n(2) Any owner, occupier or person having the overall management of\n\nthe designated premises who contravenes subregulation (1) commits an offence\n\nand shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or\n\nimprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both.\n\nDuties and powers of fire safety organization\n\n6E. A fire safety organization shall have the following duties:\n\n(a) to be responsible for fire safety of the designated premises\n\nin respect of which it is established;\n\n(b) upon an outbreak of fire or any other emergencies at the\n\ndesignated premises but before the arrival of a\n\nFire Officer—\n\n(i) to give instructions for the purpose of evacuation or\n\nexit of the occupants of the designated premises; and\n\n(ii) to extinguish, fight, prevent and control the fire or\n\nemergency by using all fire-fighting equipments or\n\nfire safety installations in the designated premises,\n\nas the case may be;\n\n(c) to remove or cause to be removed any fire hazard found\n\nwithin the designated premises;\n\n(d) to prepare a Fire and Emergency Response Plan and a\n\nFire Safety Report;\n\n(e) to ensure a copy of a Fire and Emergency Response Plan\n\nand all the records or documents relating to it are kept at\n\nthe fire command centre;\n\n(f) to ensure that all fire-fighting equipment or fire safety\n\ninstallation and fire command centre in the designated\n\npremises are maintained and remain in good condition;\n\n(g) to attend any course or training as may be determined by\n\nthe Director General;\n\n(h) to conduct any course or training relating to fire safety and\n\nemergency for the occupants of the designated premises at\n\nleast once a year;\n\n(i) to conduct a fire drill at the designated premises at least\n\nonce a year; and\n\n(j) to perform such other duties as the Director General\n\nmay direct.\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 7\n\n10. Regulation 7 of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for the\n\nwords \"regulation 3, 5 or 6\" the words \"regulation 5 or 6\".\n\nSubstitution of Schedule A\n\n11. The principal Regulations are amended by substituting for Schedule A the\n\nfollowing schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nFORM\n\n[Subregulation 2(1)]\n\nAPPLICATION FOR FIRE CERTIFICATE\n\nPART I\n\nDirector General,\n\nFire and Rescue Department,\n\nState …………………………….....\n\nI/We........................................................................................................................................... wish to apply\n\nfor a fire a certificate for the following designated premises: (State full address of the\n\ndesignated premises) …………………………………………………………………………………………………...\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\nPART II\n\n1. Name of applicant (owner/occupier/person having overall management of the\n\ndesignated premises):\n\n………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n2. Postal address: ……………………………………………………………………………………………………....\n\n………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n3. Identification card number: ……………………………………………………………………………………\n\n4. Telephone number: …………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n5. E-mail address: ……………………………………………………………………………………………...\n\n6. Name of the latest owner of the designated premises:\n\n………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n(please attach certified copy)\n\n7. Business registration number: ……………………………………………………………………………….\n\nDistrict: …………………………………… State: …………………………………………………………..\n\n8. Date of approval and reference number of approved plans of the designated\n\npremises:\n\n(a) Local Authority reference number: …………………………………………………………………\n\n Date of approval: ……………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n (b) Fire and Rescue Department reference number: ……………………………………………...\n\n Date of approval: .................................................................................................................................\n\n9. Fire safety organization\n\n(a) Registration No.: ………………………………………………..\n\n(please attach a copy of certificate of establishment of the fire safety\n\norganization)\n\n(b) Fire safety manager ( YES / NO )\n\n Name: ………………………………………………………………..\n\n Registration No.: ………………………………………………...\n\n (please attach certified copy)\n\n(c) Fire safety officer (Attachment) ……………… number(s)\n\n10. A copy of a Fire and Emergency Response Plan ( YES / NO )\n\n11. A copy of a Fire Safety Report ( YES / NO )\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nParticulars regarding date of installation, approval of system by the Fire and Rescue\n\nDepartment together with information regarding the contractor need to be submitted.\n\nI/We certify that to the best of my/our knowledge, all the information given in the\n\napplication form is true and correct.\n\nDate: ........................................\n\nApplicant's signature: ………………………………………..\n\n(Official stamp)\n\nAttachment\n\nList of Fire Safety Officers\n\nName of the Designated Premises: ………………………………………………………………………………\n\nNo. Name Registration No. Date of Registration\n\n\".\n\nSubstitution of Schedule B\n\n12. The principal Regulations are amended by substituting for Schedule B the\n\nfollowing schedule:\n\n\"SECOND SCHEDULE\n\nFORM\n\n[Subregulation 3(1)]\n\nFIRE CERTIFICATE\n\nThis is to certify that the designated premises\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\nhas complied with the requirements relating to fire-fighting equipment or fire safety\n\ninstallation in accordance with the Fire Services Act 1988.\n\nThis is also to certify that a fire safety organization has been established and a Fire and\n\nEmergency Response Plan and a Fire Safety Report have been prepared, in respect of\n\nthe designated premises in accordance with the Fire Services Act 1988.\n\nThis certificate is valid from ...........................................................to …………………..................................\n\n ……….......................................\n\nDirector General\n\nFire and Rescue Department\".\n\nNew Third Schedule, Fourth Schedule, Fifth Schedule and Sixth Schedule\n\n13. The principal Regulations are amended by inserting after the Second Schedule as\n\namended the following schedules:\n\n\"THIRD SCHEDULE\n\nFORM\n\n[Paragraph 4(2)(a)]\n\nAPPLICATION FOR RENEWAL OF FIRE CERTIFICATE\n\nDirector,\n\nFire and Rescue Department,\n\nState...........................\n\nI/We............................................................................................................................................... wish to apply\n\nfor the renewal of the fire certificate for the following designated premises:\n\n(State full address of the designated premises)\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n2. Reference number: ………………………………………………….\n\n*3. I/We hereby declare that there is no significant change to the designated\n\npremises and therefore information given in the First Schedule of my/our application\n\nin respect of the designated premises dated ..................................................................... is still\n\napplicable.\n\n*4. I/We hereby declare that there is/are significant change/s to the designated\n\npremises, therefore I/we resubmit Part II of the First Schedule of my/our application in\n\nrespect of the designated premises (Please fill up Part II of the First Schedule).\n\n*5. I/We hereby declare that there is/are significant change/s to the designated\n\npremises, therefore I/we resubmit the First Schedule of my/our application in respect\n\nof the designated premises.\n\n6. I/We hereby submit the latest Fire Safety Report.\n\n7. I/We hereby submit the latest Fire and Emergency Response Plan (if applicable).\n\nDate: .........................................\n\nApplicant's signature: ................................................\n\n(Official stamp)\n\n* Delete if not applicable\n\nFOURTH SCHEDULE\n\nFORM\n\n[Subregulation 6C(1)]\n\nAPPLICATION FOR ESTABLISHMENT OF FIRE SAFETY ORGANIZATION\n\nDirector General,\n\nFire and Rescue Department\n\nI/We............................................................................................................................................................................\n\n(Name of applicant (owner/occupier/person having overall management of the\n\ndesignated premises). Identification card number: ……………………………………………… wish\n\nto apply for the establishment of a fire safety organization in respect of the following\n\ndesignated premises: (State name and full address of the designated premises)\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n2. Fire safety manager\n\nName: …………………………………………………………………\n\nRegistration No.: …………………………………………………\n\n (please attach certified copy)\n\n3. Fire safety officer (Attachment) ……………… number(s)\n\nI/ We certify that to the best of my/our knowledge all the information given in the\n\napplication form is true and correct.\n\nDate: ........................................\n\nApplicant's signature: ………………………………………..\n\n(Official stamp)\n\nAttachment\n\nList of Fire Safety Officers\n\nName of the Designated Premises: ………………………………………………………………………………\n\nNo. Name Registration No. Date of Registration\n\nFIFTH SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 6C(3)]\n\nCERTIFICATE OF ESTABLISHMENT OF FIRE SAFETY ORGANIZATION\n\nRegistration No.: ........................................\n\nThis is to certify that the designated premises\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\n.......................................................................................................................................................................................\n\nhas established a fire safety organization in the designated premises as required under\n\nsection 27A of the Fire Services Act 1988.\n\n ................................................................\n\nDirector General\n\nFire and Rescue Department\n\nSIXTH SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulations 3(3) and 4(3)]\n\nFEE FOR FIRE CERTIFICATE AND RENEWED FIRE CERTIFICATE\n\nDesignated Premises\n\nAccording to Use Fees\n\nFire Certificate\n\n(RM)\n\nRenewed Fire\n\nCertificate\n\n(RM)\n\n1. Library 300.00 150.00\n\n2. Hospital and nursing home 400.00 200.00\n\n3. Hotel 500.00 250.00\n\n4. Hostel and dormitory 300.00 150.00\n\n5. Office 400.00 200.00\n\n6. Shop 500.00 250.00\n\n7. Factory 1,000.00 500.00\n\n8. Place of assembly 300.00 150.00\n\n9. Storage and other premises 500.00 250.00\n\nNOTE:\n\nWhere any designated premises are used for more than one purposes, the fee payable\n\nshall be the highest of the fees prescribed for such purposes.\".\n\nSavings and transitional\n\n14. (1) Any application for a fire certificate made under the principal Regulations\n\nbefore the date of coming into operation of these Regulations and pending under the\n\nprincipal Regulations shall, on the date of coming into operation of these Regulations,\n\nbe dealt with under the principal Regulations as if the principal Regulations had not\n\nbeen amended by these Regulations.\n\n(2) Any application for the renewal of a fire certificate made under the\n\nprincipal Regulations before the date of coming into operation of these Regulations and\n\npending under the principal Regulations shall, on the date of coming into operation of\n\nthese Regulations, be dealt with under the principal Regulations as if the principal\n\nRegulations had not been amended by these Regulations.\n\n(3) Any fire certificate issued under the principal Regulations before the date\n\nof coming into operation of these Regulations shall, on the date of coming into operation\n\nof these Regulations, be deemed to have been issued under the principal Regulations as\n\namended by these Regulations and shall continue to be valid until cancelled or expired.\n\n(4) Any owner, occupier or person having the overall management of a\n\ndesignated premises who, immediately before the coming into operation of these\n\nRegulations, has been issued with a fire certificate for that designated premises under\n\nthe principal Regulations shall, within twelve months from the date of coming into\n\noperation of these Regulations, apply for the establishment of a fire safety organization\n\nin respect of that designated premises in accordance with the principal Regulations as\n\namended by these Regulations.\n\nMade 28 September 2020\n\n[KPKT/PUU(R)/8/11 Jld.2; PN(PU2)471/VI]\n\nHAJAH ZURAIDA BINTI KAMARUDDIN\n\nMinister of Housing and Local Government"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3885"] = {"id":"MY-H3885","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年通信与多媒体（许可）（对砂拉越多媒体管理局的豁免）令","en":"COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION TO SARAWAK MULTIMEDIA AUTHORITY) ORDER 2021","orig":"COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION TO SARAWAK MULTIMEDIA AUTHORITY) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Komunikasi dan Multimedia (Pelesenan) (Pengecualian kepada Pihak Berkuasa Multimedia Sarawak) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Truyền thông và đa phương tiện (Cấp phép) (Miễn trừ cho Cơ quan Đa phương tiện Sarawak) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งการสื่อสารและมัลติมีเดีย (การออกใบอนุญาต) (การยกเว้นให้องค์กรสื่อมัลติมีเดียซาราวัก) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Komunikasi dan Multimedia (Perizinan) (Pengecualian kepada Otoritas Multimedia Sarawak) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)290-2021_COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (EXEMPTION TO SARAWAK MULTIMEDIA AUTHORITY) ORDER 202.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3885-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Komunikasi dan Multimedia\n\n(Pelesenan) (Pengecualian kepada Lembaga Multimedia Sarawak) 2021.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3885-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan Lembaga Multimedia Sarawak, suatu badan yang\n\nditubuhkan di bawah Ordinan Lembaga Multimedia Sarawak 2017 [Bab 73],\n\ndaripada pemakaian perenggan 126(1)(a) dan (b) Akta tertakluk kepada syarat\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam perenggan 3.\n\nSyarat pengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3885-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pengecualian di bawah perenggan 2 tidak mengecualikan Lembaga Multimedia\n\nSarawak daripada pemakaian peruntukan lain Akta.\n\nDibuat 29 Jun 2021\n\n[KKMM.PUU(S)600-1/7/4; PN(PU2)601/XI]\n\n DATO' SAIFUDDIN ABDULLAH\n\n Menteri Komunikasi dan Multimedia\n\nCOMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA ACT 1998\n\nCOMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING)\n\n(EXEMPTION TO SARAWAK MULTIMEDIA AUTHORITY) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the\n\nCommunications and Multimedia Act 1998 [Act 588], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3886"] = {"id":"MY-H3886","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年消费税（预混制剂）（付款）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (PREMIX PREPARATION) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2022","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (PREMIX PREPARATION) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Penyediaan Premiks) (Pembayaran) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Chế phẩm pha trộn sẵn) (Thanh toán) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (สิ่งปรุงผสมสำเร็จ) (การชำระเงิน) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Cukai (Sediaan Premiks) (Pembayaran) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)290-2022_EXCISE DUTIES (PREMIX PREPARATION) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3886-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah  dinamakan Perintah Duti  Eksais (Penyediaan\nPracampuran)                   (Bayaran) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2022.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H3886-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n\"penyediaan pra campuran\" ertinya barang -barang yang diperihalkan dalam\nruang (1), (2) dan (3) di bawah kepala 18.06 Bab 18, kepala 19.01 Bab 19, kepala 21.01\ndan 21.06 Bab 21, Jadual kepada Perintah Duti Eksais 2022 [P.U. (A) 163/2022];\n\n\"tempat berlesen\" ertinya mana -mana tempat pengilangan penyediaan\npracampuran yang dinyatakan dalam lesen yang dikeluarkan kepada pengilang berlesen\ndi bawah subseksyen 20(1) Akta.\n\nDuti eksais"}},{"id":"MY-H3886-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Duti eksais pada kadar yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (5) Jadual kepada\nPerintah Duti Eksais 2022 hendaklah dilevi ke atas dan dibayar oleh pengilang berlesen\ndan pemegang lesen  penyediaan pracampuran berkenaan dengan barang -barang yang\ndikilangkan di Malays ia yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual kepada\nPerintah Duti Eksais 2022.\n\nCara pembayaran  bagi pemindahan penyediaan pra campuran dari tempat\nberlesen atau gudang berlesen"}},{"id":"MY-H3886-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Duti eksais hendaklah dibayar oleh pengilang berlesen atau pemegang\nlesen, yang memindahkan penyediaan pra campuran berkenaan dari tempat berlesen\natau gudang berlesen  itu untuk kegunaan dalam Malaysia,  selewat-lewatnya pada\nhari terakhir bulan berikutnya.\n\n (2) Ketua Pengarah boleh, jika berpuas hati sedemikian, membenarkan suatu\nsekuriti diberikan ole h pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen  bagi pembayaran\nduti eksais bagi penyediaan pra campuran yang dipindahkan dari tempat berlesen atau\ngudang berlesen.\n\n (3) Sekuriti yang diberikan di bawah subp erenggan (2) hendaklah menjadi\nkena dibayar oleh pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen bagi penyediaan\npracampuran yang dipindahkan dari tempat berlesen  atau gudan g berlesen dengan\nsyarat bahawa—\n\n(a) pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen pada setiap masa adalah\nbertanggungan bagi dut i eksais ke atas penyediaan pra campuran\nyang dipindahkan dari tempat berlesen atau gudang berlesen; dan\n\n(b) Ketua Pengarah boleh menuntut bayaran duti eksais daripada\npengilang berlesen atau pemega ng lesen ke atas penyediaan\npracampuran yang dipindahkan dari tempat berlesen  atau gudang\nberlesen jika Ketua Pengarah mempunyai sebab untuk mempercayai\npenyediaan pracampuran itu tidak dapat diakaunkan.\n\nDibuat 7 September 2022\n[S.KE.HT(96)669/19-8 Klt.4 Sk.7; MOF.TAX (S)700-1/3/97; PN(PU2)337/Jld. 26]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n    Menteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 6(2) Akta Eksais 1976]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (PREMIX PREPARATION) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(1) of the Excise Act 1976 [ Act 176],\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3887"] = {"id":"MY-H3887","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第26号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 26) ORDER 2023","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 26) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 26) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 26) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 26) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 26) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2023_P.U.(A)290-2023_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 26) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3887-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 26) 2023.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 30 September 2023.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H3887-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan atau penggunaan kenderaan motor di bawah kelas kenderaan yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua, pada hari dan masa yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama,\n\ndilarang.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3887-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pengecualian daripada larangan itu hendaklah diberikan bagi maksud dan dalam\n\nhal keadaan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Ketiga.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n(2)\n\nKelas Kenderaan\n\n(3)\n\nHari dan Masa\n\nLarangan\n\nLebuh Raya Lembah Klang Selatan\n\nbermula dari kilometer 19.20 arah\n\nbarat di koordinat U 325683.941,\n\nT 399015.806 Grid Bentuk Benar\n\nSerong Ditepati (RSO) Geosentrik\n\nDatum Malaysia (GDM2000)\n\ndan kilometer 19.99 arah timur\n\ndi koordinat U 325498.635,\n\nT 397933.624 Grid RSO GDM2000\n\ndan berakhir di Had Sempadan\n\nPenyenggaraan di koordinat\n\nU 326724.774, T 398301.051\n\nGrid RSO GDM2000 sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKelas 2: Kenderaan\n\nyang mempunyai dua\n\ngandar dan enam roda\n\n(kecuali bas dan van)\n\nKelas 3: Kenderaan\n\nyang mempunyai tiga\n\ngandar atau lebih\n\n(kecuali bas)\n\nIsnin hingga Jumaat\n\n(kecuali hari\n\nkelepasan am)\n\nPagi: 6.30 pagi\n\nhingga 9.30 pagi\n\nPetang: 4.30 petang\n\nhingga 7.30 malam\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nPERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT BANDAR SAUJANA PUTRA\n\nJADUAL KETIGA\n\nPENGECUALIAN\n\n1. Bagi maksud penyelenggaraan, pembaikan, peningkatan, pembersihan\n\ndan pemugaran bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama.\n\n2. Bagi maksud pemacakan, pemasangan, penyelenggaraan, pengubahan\n\natau pengalihan mana-mana struktur, kerja, peralatan atau apa-apa benda\n\ndi dalam, di bawah atau di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama.\n\n3. Bagi maksud perkhidmatan kecemasan dan penguatkuasaan oleh agensi Kerajaan\n\ndan pihak berkuasa tempatan.\n\n4. Bagi maksud perkhidmatan pembersihan, pembuangan dan penghantaran\n\nsisa domestik oleh kenderaan motor di bawah kelas kenderaan yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama seperti lori sampah, lori pembersihan\n\npembentungan dan lori vakum pembentungan.\n\n5. Bagi maksud kecemasan jika penggunaan mana-mana jalan selain yang terdapat\n\ndalam koordinat yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama menjadi\n\nmustahil atau tidak sesuai.\n\nDibuat 27 September 2023\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.7; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 129]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 26) ORDER 2023\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 403/2023 published on 15 September 2023, notice was given\n\nof the intention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the making\n\nof such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to\n\nin subsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use\n\nof Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 26) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 30 September 2023.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving or use of motor vehicles under the classes of vehicles specified\n\nin column (2) of the First Schedule, on the part of the road specified in column (1)\n\nof the First Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, on the day and time\n\nspecified in column (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nExemption\n\n3. Exemption from such prohibition shall be given for the purposes\n\nand in circumstances specified in the Third Schedule.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nClasses of Vehicles\n\n(3)\n\nDay and Time\n\nof Prohibition\n\nThe South Klang Valley\n\nExpressway starting from\n\nkilometre 19.20 west bound\n\nat coordinates N 325683.941,\n\nE 399015.806 of the Rectified Skew\n\nOrthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric\n\nDatum of Malaysia (GDM2000)\n\nGrid and kilometre 19.99\n\neast bound at coordinates\n\nN 325498.635, E 397933.624 ofthe\n\nRSO GDM2000 Grid and ending\n\nat the Limit of Maintenance\n\nResponsibility at coordinates\n\nN 326724.774, E 398301.051\n\nof the RSO GDM2000 Grid as shown\n\non the map in the Second Schedule\n\nClass 2: Vehicles having\n\ntwo axles and six\n\nwheels (excluding\n\nbuses and vans).\n\nClass 3: Vehicles having\n\nthree axles or more\n\n(excluding buses)\n\nMonday to Friday\n\n(except public holiday)\n\nMorning: 6.30 a.m. to\n\n9.30 a.m.\n\nEvening: 4.30 p.m.\n\nto 7.30 p.m.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nBANDAR SAUJANA PUTRA INTERCHANGE\n\nTHIRD SCHEDULE\n\nEXEMPTION\n\n1. For the purposes of maintenance, repair, improvement, cleaning and clearance\n\nof the part of the road specified in column (1) of the First Schedule.\n\n2. For the purposes of erection, installation, maintenance, alteration or removal\n\nof any structure, works, apparatus or anything in, under or over the part\n\nof the road specified in column (1) of the First Schedule.\n\n3. For the purposes of emergency services and enforcement by the Government\n\nagencies and local authorities.\n\n4. For the purposes of cleaning services, disposal and delivery of domestic waste\n\nby motor vehicle under the classes of vehicles specified in column (2)\n\nof the First Schedule such as garbage truck, sewerage cleaning truck and sewerage\n\nvacuum truck.\n\n5. For the purposes of emergency if the use of any road other than which appears\n\nin the coordinates specified in column (1) of the First Schedule is rendered\n\nimpossible or unsuitable.\n\nMade 27 September 2023\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.7; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 129]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3888"] = {"id":"MY-H3888","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（首次公开发行）（豁免）令","en":"INCOME TAX (INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Tawaran Awam Permulaan) (Pengecualian) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Phát hành cổ phiếu lần đầu ra công chúng) (Miễn trừ) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การเสนอขายหุ้นต่อประชาชนทั่วไปครั้งแรก) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Penawaran Umum Perdana) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)290-2024_INCOME TAX (INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3888-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah  dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Tawaran Awam Permulaan) (Pengecualian) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai 1 Mac 2024 hingga 31 Disember 2028.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H3888-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n\"bursa saham\" ertinya Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad;\n\n\"Pasaran ACE\" ertinya Pasaran Akses, Pasti, Cekap di Bursa Malaysia\nSecurities Berhad;\n\n\"Pasaran LEAP\" ertinya Pasaran Platform Pengembangan Usahawan Unggul\ndi Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad;\n\n\"Pasaran Utama\" ertinya Pasaran Utama di Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H3888-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Menteri mengecualikan suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad,\nbadan amanah atau koperasi daripada pembayaran cukai pendapatan berkenaan dengan\npendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai daripada laba atau keuntungan yang diterima\ndaripada pelupusan syer  suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di Malaysia yang\ntidak tersenarai di bursa saham.\n\n (2) Bagi maksud pengecualian di bawah subperenggan (1)—\n\n(a) pelupusan syer  itu hendaklah dibuat dalam tempoh\nmulai 1 Mac 2024 hingga 31 Disember 2028;\n\n(b) syer itu hendaklah dilupuskan berhubung dengan penstrukturan\nsemula mana-mana syarikat bagi suatu tawaran awam permulaan;\n\n(c) syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau koperasi\nitu hendaklah memohon bagi tawaran awam permulaan itu\ndi bawah Akta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007 [ Akta 671]\ndalam tempoh satu tahun dari tarikh pelupusan syer itu—\n\n(i) kepada Suruhanjaya Sekuriti bagi maksud penyenaraian\ndi Pasaran Utama; atau\n\n(ii) kepada Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad bagi maksud\npenyenaraian di Pasaran ACE dan Pasaran LEAP; dan\n\n(d) syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau koperasi\nitu hendaklah me ndapatkan kelulusan bagi permohonan tawaran\nawam permulaan yang disebut dalam subsubperenggan (2) (c)\npada atau sebelum 31 Disember 2028.\n\n(3) Syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau koperasi itu\nhendaklah memohon secara bertulis kepada Ketua Pengarah  dalam tempoh satu tahun\ndari tarikh kelulusan bagi  permohonan tawaran awam permulaan  yang disebut\ndalam subsubperenggan (2)(c).\n\n(4) Tiada apa -apa jua dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah\natau koperasi  itu daripada mematuhi apa -apa kehendak untuk mengemukakan\napa-apa penyata atau penyata akaun atau untuk memberikan apa -apa maklumat lain\ndi bawah Akta.\n\nKerugian daripada pelupusan syer"}},{"id":"MY-H3888-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Jika syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau koperasi itu\nmengalami apa-apa kerugian daripada pelupusan syer yang disebut dalam perenggan 3\ndalam tempoh  mulai 1 Mac 2024 hingga 31 Disember 2028 , kerugian itu tidak boleh\ndiambil kira bagi maksud subseksyen 65E(5) dan (6) Akta.\n\nKetidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H3888-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Perintah ini tidak terpakai bagi—\n\n(a) suatu pelupusan syer suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di Malaysia yang\ntidak tersenarai di bursa saham yang laba atau keuntungan daripada\npelupusan syer itu dikenakan cukai sebagai suatu pendapatan perniagaan\ndi bawah perenggan 4(a) Akta;\n\n(b) suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau\nkoperasi yang telah membuat suatu permohonan untuk pengecualian\ndi bawah Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Skim Penstrukturan Semula\nSyarikat) ( Pengecualian) 2024 [ P.U. (A)  289/2024] berkenaan dengan\npelupusan syer yang sama; atau\n\n(c) suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, badan amanah atau\nkoperasi yang telah diberikan pengecualian cukai di bawah\nperenggan 127(3) (b) atau subseksyen 127(3 A) Akta berkenaan  dengan\npelupusan syer yang sama.\n\nDibuat 19 September 2024\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/115; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7 (29)-337; PN(PU2)80/JLD.112]\n\n                       DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                  Menteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H3889"] = {"id":"MY-H3889","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 290/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（南北大道中环连接线与吉隆坡国际机场大道）（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (NORTH SOUTH EXPRESSWAY CENTRAL LINK AND KLIA EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (NORTH SOUTH EXPRESSWAY CENTRAL LINK AND KLIA EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Utara-Selatan Pautan Tengah dan Lebuh Raya KLIA) (Pindaan) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Bắc Nam Nhánh liên kết trung tâm và Đường cao tốc KLIA) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางด่วนเหนือ-ใต้ ส่วนเชื่อมกลาง และทางด่วน KLIA) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Tol Utara-Selatan Tautan Tengah dan Jalan Tol KLIA) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA290","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)290-2025_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (NORTH SOUTH EXPRESSWAY CENTRAL LINK A.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3889-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuhraya Utara Selatan Hubungan\n\nTengah dan Lebuhraya KLIA) (Pindaan) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 31 Ogos 2025.\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga Belas"}},{"id":"MY-H3889-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuhraya Utara Selatan Hubungan Tengah dan Lebuhraya KLIA) 2002 [P.U. (A) 437/2002]\n\ndipinda dalam Jadual Ketiga Belas dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 7\n\nbutiran yang berikut:\n\n\"8. Mana-mana kenderaan Kerajaan yang mempunyai lambang rasmi\n\nJabatan Pengangkutan Jalan yang dilekatkan pada bahagian kiri dan kanan\n\nbadan kenderaan itu, dan dilekatkan secara kekal dengan lampu amaran\n\nkhas yang memancarkan cahaya berkelip biru pada bumbung kenderaan itu,\n\nbagi maksud menjalankan tugas penguatkuasaan.\".\n\nDibuat 26 Ogos 2025\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/43; PN(PU2)426/JLD.73]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(NORTH SOUTH EXPRESSWAY CENTRAL LINK AND KLIA EXPRESSWAY)\n\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Federal Roads\n\n(Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
