  FT["MY-H4055"] = {"id":"MY-H4055","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 300/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA300","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)300-2016_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4055-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) 2016.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Disember 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H4055-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua, selain di\n\natas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, bagi tempoh yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya larangan\n\nterpakai\n\n(2)\n\nJalan arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 1, Jalan\n\nKuala Lumpur–Tanjung\n\nMalim bermula dari\n\nseksyen 442.7 sehingga\n\nseksyen 442.8 sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam\n\npeta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Kuala Lumpur ke\n\nTanjung Malim hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan lencongan\n\nsementara sebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\n1 Disember 2016\n\nhingga 31 Disember\n\nKenderaan dari Tanjung Malim\n\nke Kuala Lumpur hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan lencongan\n\nsementara sebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\n1 Disember 2016\n\nhingga 31 Disember\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 30 November 2016\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15; PN(PU2)460/LXXXVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 469/2016 published on 15 November 2016, notice was given of\n\nthe intention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport\n\nAct 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the\n\nmaking of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by sections 70 of the\n\nAct, the Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use of\n\nRoad) (Federal Roads) Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 December 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in column\n\n(3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which prohibition\n\napplies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition\n\nperiod\n\nPart of Route 1, Kuala\n\nLumpur-Tanjung Malim\n\nstarting from section 442.7 to\n\nsection 442.8 as shown on the\n\nmap in the Second Schedule\n\nVehicle from Kuala Lumpur\n\nto Tanjung Malim shall use\n\ntemporary diversion road as\n\nshown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\n1 December\n\n2016 to 31\n\nDecember 2017\n\nVehicle from Tanjung Malim\n\nto Kuala Lumpur shall use\n\ntemporary diversion road as\n\nshown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\n1 December\n\n2016 to 31\n\nDecember 2017\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 30 November 2016\n\nKKR.PUU.110-1/6/15; PN(PU2)460/LXXXVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4056"] = {"id":"MY-H4056","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 300/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第27号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 27) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 27) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 27) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 27) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 27) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 27) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA300","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)300-2017_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4056-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel )\n(No. 27) 2017.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 Oktober 2017.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H4056-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H4056-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel ) (No. 26) 2017 [P.U. (A) 273/2017] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 27 September 2017 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 27) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97/\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.49\n\nPetrol RON95/\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.19\n\nDiesel Euro2/\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.17\n\nDiesel Euro5/\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.27\n\nDibuat 4 Oktober 2017\nMade 4 October 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XIX]\n\nDATO' SRI JAMIL BIN SALLEH\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 4 Oktober 2017\nApproved 4 October 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XIX]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri, Koperasi dan Kepenggunaan/\nMinister of Domestic Trade, Co-operatives and Consumerism"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
