  FT["MY-H4422"] = {"id":"MY-H4422","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2015&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年护照（塞尔维亚共和国公民签证）（豁免）令","en":"PASSPORTS (VISA TO THE CITIZEN OF THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2015","orig":"PASSPORTS (VISA TO THE CITIZEN OF THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Pasport (Visa kepada Warganegara Republik Serbia) (Pengecualian) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Hộ chiếu (Thị thực cho công dân Cộng hòa Serbia) (Miễn trừ) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งหนังสือเดินทาง (วีซ่าสำหรับพลเมืองสาธารณรัฐเซอร์เบีย) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Paspor (Visa bagi Warga Negara Republik Serbia) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)323-2015_PASSPORTS (VISA TO THE CITIZEN OF THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4422-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pasport (Visa kepada\n\nWarganegara Republik Serbia) (Pengecualian) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa dari 1 Januari 2016\n\nhingga 31 Disember 2016.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H4422-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini, \"dokumen perjalanan yang sah\" ertinya Pasport Diplomatik,\n\nRasmi atau Biasa yang dikeluarkan kepada warganegara Republik Serbia.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H4422-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Menteri mengecualikan semua warganegara Republik Serbia yang mempunyai\n\ndokumen perjalanan yang sah daripada keperluan visa yang dikehendaki di bawah\n\nsubseksyen 2(1) Akta tertakluk kepada syarat yang berikut:\n\n(a) tempoh Pas Lawatan Sosial yang diberikan kepada warganegara Republik\n\nSerbia hanya terhad kepada tiga puluh hari bagi setiap kemasukan tanpa\n\napa-apa pelanjutan tempoh;\n\n(b) warganegara Republik Serbia tidak dibenarkan memohon apa-apa pas\n\nlain yang dikeluarkan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Imigresen 1963\n\n[L.N 228/1963]; dan\n\n(c) warganegara Republik Serbia hendaklah masuk dan keluar dari Malaysia\n\nhanya melalui pintu masuk yang dibenarkan sebagaimana yang\n\ndiwartakan di bawah subseksyen 5(1) Akta Imigresen 1959/63\n\n[Akta 155].\n\nDibuat 23 Disember 2015\n\n[KDN(S):100/938/1-7; PN(PU2)482]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPASSPORTS ACT 1966\n\nPASSPORTS (VISA TO THE CITIZEN OF THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA)\n\n(EXEMPTION) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the Passports Act 1966 [Act 150],\n\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4423"] = {"id":"MY-H4423","coverage":"partial","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2016&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年商品说明（廉价销售价格）（修正）条例","en":"TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CHEAP SALE PRICE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016","orig":"TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CHEAP SALE PRICE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016","ms":"Peraturan Keterangan Perdagangan (Harga Jualan Murah) (Pindaan) 2016","vi":"Quy định về Mô tả thương mại (Giá bán hạ) (Sửa đổi) năm 2016","th":"ข้อบังคับคำบรรยายสินค้า (ราคาขายต่ำ) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Peraturan Keterangan Dagang (Harga Jual Murah) (Perubahan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2016_P.U.(A)323-2016_TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CHEAP SALE PRICE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4423-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nPerihal Dagangan (Harga Jualan Murah) (Pindaan) 2016.\n\n (2)  Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2017.\n\nPindaan peraturan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H4423-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Perihal Dagangan (Harga Juala n Murah ) 1997\n[P.U. (A) 424/ 1997], yang disebut \"Peraturan -Peraturan ibu\" dalam\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini, dipinda dalam peraturan 5—\n\n(a) dalam nota birai, dengan men ggantikan perkataan \"lima\" dengan\nperkataan \"empat\";\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (1)—\n\n(i) dengan menggantikan perkataan \" lima\" dengan perkataan\n\"empat\"; dan\n\n(ii) dalam perenggan (b),  dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dua kali\"\ndengan perkataan \"satu kali\";\n\n(c) dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dalam subperatur an (3), dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \"sales\" dengan perkataan \"sale\";\n\n(d) dengan memotong subperaturan (3A);\n\n(e) dalam  subperaturan (4) , dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dua kali\njualan\" dengan perkataan \"jualan\"; dan\n\n(f) dalam subperaturan (5), dengan memotong perkataan \"(3A) atau\".\n\nPeraturan baharu 6A"}},{"id":"MY-H4423-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas peraturan 6\nperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"Peratusan\nminimum bagi\npengurangan\nharga"}},{"id":"MY-H4423-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6A. (1) Bagi maksud jualan pada harga jualan murah\ndi bawah peratura n 5, peratusan minimum bagi\npengurangan harga barang -barang yang dibekalkan atau\nditawar untuk dibekalkan hendaklah tidak kurang daripada\nsepuluh peratus daripada harga yang barang -barang itu\ndibekalkan atau ditawar untuk dibekalkan dahulu olehnya\nsebagaimana yang dikehendaki untuk ditunjukkan di bawah\nperenggan 8(1)(a).\n\n (2)   Mana-mana   orang   yang   melanggar\nsubperaturan (1) melakukan suatu kesalahan dan boleh,\napabila disabitkan—\n\n(a) jika orang itu ialah suatu pertubuhan\nperbadanan, dide nda tidak melebihi satu\nratus ribu ringgit, dan bagi kesalahan yang\nkedua atau yang berikutnya, didenda tidak\nmelebihi dua ratus ribu ringgit; atau\n\n(b) jika orang itu bukan suatu pertubuhan\nperbadanan, didenda tidak melebihi lima\npuluh ribu ringgit atau dipe njarakan selama\n\ntempoh tidak melebihi tiga tahun, dan bagi\nkesalahan yang kedua atau yang berikutnya,\ndidenda tidak melebihi satu ratus ribu\nringgit atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh\ntidak melebihi lima tahun.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 7\n4. Peraturan 7 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam nota birai, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"tujuh puluh\" dengan\nperkataan \"lima puluh\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"tujuh puluh\"\ndengan perkataan \"lima puluh\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 8\n5. Subperaturan 8(3) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan me nggantikan\nperkataan \"enam\" dengan perkataan \"tiga\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 9\n6. Peraturan 9 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"enam\" dengan\nperkataan \"tiga\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"enam \" dengan\nperkataan \"tiga\".\n\nDibuat 14 Disember 2016\n[KPDN(BUU)(PU2) 26/5/4 Jld. 4; PN(PU2)120/VIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nTRADE DESCRIPTIONS ACT 2011\n\nTRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CHEAP SALE PRICE) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 69 of the\nTrade Descriptions Act 2011 [Act 730], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4424"] = {"id":"MY-H4424","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年所得税（豁免）（第9号）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2017","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 9) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (số 9) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 9) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 9) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)323-2017_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4424-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)   Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 9) 2017.\n\n     (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 September 2017.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H4424-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Menteri mengecualikan orang yang tidak bermastautin di Malaysia\ndaripada pembayaran cukai pendapatan berkenaan dengan pendapatan yang diperoleh\ndari Malaysia berhubung dengan—\n\n(a) perkhidmatan yang disebut dalam perenggan 4A(i) Akta; atau\n\n(b) nasihat, bantuan atau perkhidmatan teknikal yang disebut dalam\nperenggan 4A(ii) Akta,\n\nyang diberikan atau dilaksanakan oleh orang itu di luar Malaysia.\n\n(2) Tiada apa -apa dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan orang  itu daripada mematuhi apa -apa kehendak bagi\nmengemukakan apa-apa penyata atau penyata akaun atau untuk memberikan apa -apa\nmaklumat lain, di bawah Akta.\n\nKetidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H4424-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Seksyen 109B Akta tidak terpakai bagi pendapatan yang disebut\ndalam perenggan 2.\n\nDibuat 23 Oktober  2017\n[Perb.CR(8.09)294/6/4-18(SJ.5)(2016)(SK.3);LHDN.AY.A600-12/1/6; PN(PU2)80/LXXXVIII ]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai\nPendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3) (b) of the\nIncome Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4425"] = {"id":"MY-H4425","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第5号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 5) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 5) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 5) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 5) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)323-2018_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4425-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 5) 2018.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari 23 Disember 2018\nhingga 27 Disember 2018.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H4425-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal  sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri-Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H4425-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H4425-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal  sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 5) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4426"] = {"id":"MY-H4426","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第42号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 42) ORDER 2019","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 42) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 42) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 42) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 42) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 42) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)323-2019_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4426-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan\n(Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (No. 42) 2019.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H4426-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H4426-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel)  (No. 41) 2019 [P.U. (A) 319/2019] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 15 November 2019 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 42) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\n                     Class of petrol and diesel\n\n Harga seliter/\n                               Price per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.66\n\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.08\n\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 22 November 2019\nMade 22 November 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXV]\n\nDATUK MUEZ BIN ABD AZIZ\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 22 November 2019\nApproved 22 November 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXV]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4427"] = {"id":"MY-H4427","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年雇员社会保障（最低月平均工资）条例","en":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (MINIMUM AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGE) REGULATIONS 2022","orig":"EMPLOYEES’ SOCIAL SECURITY (MINIMUM AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGE) REGULATIONS 2022","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Upah Purata Bulanan Minimum) 2022","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người lao động (Tiền lương bình quân tháng tối thiểu) năm 2022","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมลูกจ้าง (ค่าจ้างเฉลี่ยรายเดือนขั้นต่ำ) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Karyawan (Upah Rata-Rata Bulanan Minimum) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)323-2022_EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (MINIMUM AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGE) REGULATIONS 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4427-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Gaji Bulanan Purata Minimum) 2022.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2023.\n\nGaji bulanan purata minimum"}},{"id":"MY-H4427-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Gaji bulanan purata minimum bagi orang berinsurans bagi maksud\n\npencen ilat yang disebut dalam subseksyen 20(2) Akta atau pencen penakat\n\nyang disebut dalam perenggan 4 Jadual Kelapan kepada Akta ialah\n\nsatu ribu satu ratus ringgit.\n\n(2) Gaji bulanan purata minimum yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1)\n\nhendaklah terpakai bagi orang berinsurans jika kadar pencen ilat atau pencen penakat\n\nyang diterima pada 31 Disember 2022 oleh orang berinsurans itu atau orang\n\ntanggungannya, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan, kurang daripada\n\nlima ratus lima puluh ringgit.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H4427-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Gaji Bulanan Purata\n\nMinimum) 2014 [P.U. (A) 39/2014] dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 6 Oktober 2022\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/11/12(2); PN(PU2)58/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 1969\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (MINIMUM AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGE)\n\nREGULATIONS 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 105 of the\n\nEmployees' Social Security Act 1969 [Act 4], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4428"] = {"id":"MY-H4428","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年关税（修正）（第3号）条例","en":"CUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) REGULATIONS 2023","orig":"CUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) REGULATIONS 2023","ms":"Peraturan Kastam (Pindaan) (Bilangan 3) 2023","vi":"Quy định về Hải quan (Sửa đổi) (số 3) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับศุลกากร (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Peraturan Kepabeanan (Perubahan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2023_P.U.(A)323-2023_CUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) REGULATIONS 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4428-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nKastam (Pindaan) (No. 3) 2023.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2023.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H4428-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Peraturan-Peraturan Kastam 2019 [ P.U. (A) 397/2019 ] dipinda dalam\nJadual Kedua dalam Bahagian I, ber hubung dengan pelabuhan kastam  bagi Johor,\ndengan menggantikan butiran Tanjung Pelepas Port, Johor  Bahru dan butir-butir yang\nberhubungan dengannya dengan butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nPelabuhan\nKastam\nPerihal barang Tempat pendaratan yang sah di sisi undang-undang\n\nPelabuhan\nTanjung\nPelepas,\nJohor Bahru\nSemua barang\n\nBahagian kiri tebing sepanjang Sungai Pulai di—\n\n(a) Dermaga 1 hingga Dermaga 6 yang terletak\ndi garis lintang 1° 22' 27.885\" U  garis bujur\n103° 32' 37.0024\" T hingga  garis lintang  1° 21' 20.4208\" U\ngaris bujur 103° 32' 56.7317\" T;\n\n(b) Dermaga 7 hingga Dermaga 14 yang terletak\ndi garis lintang 1° 21' 18.16972\" U  garis bujur\n103° 32' 51.34746\" T hingga  garis lintang 1° 19' 48.91932\" U\ngaris bujur 103° 33' 26.76954\" T\".\n\nDibuat 18 Oktober 2023\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/02Klt.6(5); MOF.TAX(S)700-2/11/8(4); PN(PU2)338/JLD.71]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMenteri Kewangan\n\"\n\"\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) REGULATIONS 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 142 of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235],\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4429"] = {"id":"MY-H4429","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年销售税（免缴税人员）（修正）令","en":"SALES TAX (PERSONS EXEMPTED FROM PAYMENT OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","orig":"SALES TAX (PERSONS EXEMPTED FROM PAYMENT OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Orang yang Dikecualikan daripada Pembayaran Cukai) (Pindaan) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Người được miễn nộp thuế) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (บุคคลที่ได้รับการยกเว้นการชำระภาษี) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Orang yang Dibebaskan dari Pembayaran Pajak) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2025_P.U.(A)323-2025_SALES TAX (PERSONS EXEMPTED FROM PAYMENT OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4429-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Jualan ( Orang Yang\nDikecualikan Daripada Pembayaran Cukai) (Pindaan) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2025.\n\nPindaan Jadual A"}},{"id":"MY-H4429-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Jualan (Orang Yang Dikecualikan Daripada Pembayaran Cukai) 2018\n[P.U. (A) 210/2018] dipinda dalam Jadual A, dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 1 6A\ndan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(1)\nItem\nNo.\n(2)\nPersons\n(3)\nGoods Exempted\n(4)\nConditions\n(5)\n Certificate to be signed by\n\"16B. The driver\n\n(i) Motor vehicle for\nthe transport of\ngoods under\nheading 87.04\nof the Customs\nDuties Order 2022\n[P.U. (A) 114/2022];\nand\n\n(ii) fuel supply,\nlubricating oil,\nmaintenance\nsupplies and spare\nparts for the use of\nthe motor vehicle\n\n(i) That the motor\nvehicle has a\nvalid ASEAN\ngoods vehicle\ncross-border\npermit issued by\nthe relevant\nauthority of any\nASEAN member\ncountry;\n\n(ii) that the fuel\nsupply is\ncontained within\nthe supply tank\nof the  motor\nvehicle;\n\nCertificate not required\".\n(1)\nItem\nNo.\n(2)\nPersons\n(3)\nGoods Exempted\n(4)\nConditions\n(5)\n Certificate to be signed by\n(iii) that the goods\nreferred to in\ncolumn (3) may\nremain in\nMalaysia for a\nperiod not\nexceeding five\ndays from the\ntime of arrival at\nany entry point\nor within such\nfurther period as\nthe Director\nGeneral of Land\nPublic Transport\nmay allow;\n\n(iv) that the person\napproved in\ncolumn (2) shall\ncomply with any\npublic ruling\nissued by the\nDirector General\n\nDibuat 28 Ogos 2025\n[KE.HF(152)860/09 JLD.3(13); PN(PU2)751/JLD.10]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di hadapan Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 35(2) Akta Cukai Jualan 2018]\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\n\nSALES TAX (PERSONS EXEMPTED FROM PAYMENT OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 35(1)(b)\nof the Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H443"] = {"id":"MY-H443","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=567&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":10,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1997年曾卡区域发展局（解散）法","en":"LEMBAGA KEMAJUAN WILAYAH JENGKA (DISSOLUTION) ACT 1997","orig":"LEMBAGA KEMAJUAN WILAYAH JENGKA (DISSOLUTION) ACT 1997","vi":"Luật về Cơ quan Phát triển Vùng Jengka (Giải thể) năm 1997","th":"พระราชบัญญัติองค์การพัฒนาภูมิภาคเจิงกา (การเลิก) ค.ศ. 1997","id":"Undang-Undang Lembaga Pengembangan Wilayah Jengka (Pembubaran) Tahun 1997","ms":"Akta Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka (Pembubaran) 1997"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT567","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1997","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 10 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1997_567_LEMBAGA KEMAJUAN WILAYAH JENGKA (DISSOLUTION) ACT 1997.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H443-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Short title and commencement.\nInterpretation.\n\nRepeal and dissolution.\nTransfer of powers, rights, etc.\nTransfer of property.\n\nTransfer of funds.\n\nExisting contracts, etc.\n\nContinuance of criminal and civil proceedings.\n\nSey NA PP YP\n\nContinuance of laws, etc.\n\nPrevention of difficulties or anomalies.\n\n—\n=\n\nZV\n\nLAWS OF MALAYSIA\nAct 567\n\nLEMBAGA KEMAJUAN WILAYAH JENGKA\n(DISSOLUTION) ACT 1997\n\nAn Act to repeal the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka\nAct 1983, to dissolve the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah\nJengka established under the Act, to transfer all its\nproperties to the Government and to provide for other\nmatters connected therewith.\n\nBE IT ENACTED by the Seri Paduka Baginda Yang\ndi-Pertuan Agong with the advice and consent of the\nDewan Negara and Dewan Rakyat in Parliament assembled,\nand by the authority of the same, as follows:\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Lembaga Kemajuan\nWilayah Jengka (Dissolution) Act 1997 and shall come\ninto force on such date as the Minister may, by notification\nin the Gazette, appoint."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—\n\n\"appointed date\" means the date appointed by the\nMinister under section 1;\n\n\"Federal Lands Commissioner\" means the Federal Lands\nCommissioner appointed under the Federal Lands\nCommissioner Act 1957;\n\n\"Lembaga\" means the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah\nJengka established under the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah\nJengka Act 1983;\n\n\"Minister\" means the Minister charged with the\nresponsibility for rural development.\n\nShort title\nand com-\nmencement.\n\nInterpretation.\n\nAct 349.\n\nAct 285.\n\nRepeal and\ndissolution.\nAct 285.\n\nTransfer of\npowers,\nrights, etc.\n\nTransfer of\nproperty.\n\nTransfer\nof funds.\n\nExisting\ncontracts, efc.\n\nContinuance\nof criminal\nand civil\nproceedings."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. The Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka Act 1983 is\nrepealed and the Lembaga established thereunder is\ndissolved."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. All powers, rights, privileges, duties, liabilities and\nobligations which immediately before the appointed date\nwere those of the Lembaga shall, as from that date, devolve\non the Government."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. (1) Alllands which immediately before the appointed\ndate were vested in the Lembaga shall, on the appointed\ndate, vest in the Federal Lands Commissioner for the\npurposes of the Government.\n\n(2) All properties and assets other than land which\nimmediately before the appointed date were vested in the\nLembaga or in any person on its behalf shall, on that\ndate, vest in the Government."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. All moneys standing in, or due to be paid to, the\nLembaga shall, on the appointed date, be transferred to,\nand vest in the Government."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. All deeds, bonds, agreements, instruments and working\narrangements subsisting immediately before the appointed\ndate and affecting any of the property transferred under\nsection 5 shall be of full force and effect against or in\nfavour of the Government and enforceable as fully and\neffectually as if, instead of the Lembaga or any person\nacting on its behalf, the Government had been named\ntherein or had been a party thereto."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. (1) The repeal of the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah\nJengka Act 1983 shall not affect any person's liability to\nbe prosecuted or punished for offences committed under\nthe repealed Act before the appointed date, or any\nproceedings brought or sentence imposed before that date\nin respect of such offence.\n\nLembaga Kemajuan Wilayah\nJengka (Dissolution)\n\n(2) Any proceedings (whether civil or criminal) or\ncause of action pending or existing immediately before\nthe appointed date by or against the Lembaga or any\nperson acting on its behalf may be continued or instituted\nby or against the Government as it might have been\ncontinued or instituted by or against the Lembaga or such\nperson as if this Act had not been passed.\n\n(3) Any appeal brought, or any leave to appeal applied\nfor, on or after the appointed date, against a decision\ngiven before the appointed date in any legal proceedings\nto which the Lembaga was a party may be brought by or\nagainst the Government as it might have been brought by\nor against the Lembaga as if this Act had not been passed."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. Subject to this Act, all written laws, including subsidiary\nlegislation, affecting or for the protection of the Lembaga\nand in force immediately before the appointed date shall,\nuntil amended or revoked by the appropriate authority\nhaving power so to do, continue in force and be construed\nas if this Act had not been passed:\n\nProvided that any reference in such written laws to the\nLembaga, unless the context otherwise requires, shall be\nconstrued as a reference to the Government and expressions\nimporting such a reference shall be construed accordingly."}},{"id":"MY-H443-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. (1) Ifany difficulty or anomaly arises in connection\nwith the implementation of this Act, the Minister may by\norder make such modifications to any provision of this\nAct as may appear to him to be necessary for removing\nor preventing such difficulty or anomaly:\n\nProvided that the Minister shall not exercise the powers\nconferred by this section after the expiration of three\nyears from the appointed date.\n\n(2) In this section, \"modifications\" includes\namendments, additions, deletions, substitutions, adaptations,\nvariations, alteration and non-application of any provision\nof this Act.\n\nCAWANGAN KUALA LUMPUR\nBAGI PIHAK DAN DENGAN PERINTAH KERAJAAN MALAYSIA\nPNMB\n\nDICETAK OLEH\nPERCETAKAN NASIONAL MALAYSIA BERHAD,\n\nContinuance\nof laws, etc.\n\nPrevention of\ndifficulties\nor anomalies."}}],"pack":"my-9"};
  FT["MY-H4430"] = {"id":"MY-H4430","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 323/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年开发金融机构（马来西亚发展银行）（豁免）令","en":"DEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS (BANK PEMBANGUNAN MALAYSIA BERHAD) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2026","orig":"DEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS (BANK PEMBANGUNAN MALAYSIA BERHAD) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Institusi Kewangan Pembangunan (Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad) (Pengecualian) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Tổ chức tài chính phát triển (Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad) (Miễn trừ) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งสถาบันการเงินเพื่อการพัฒนา (ธนาคารเพื่อการพัฒนามาเลเซีย) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Lembaga Keuangan Pembangunan (Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA323","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2026_P.U.(A)323-2026_DEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS (BANK PEMBANGUNAN MALAYSIA BERHAD) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H4430-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Institusi Kewangan\nPembangunan (Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad) (Pengecualian) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 7 Ogos 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H4430-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan  Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad\n(Nombor Pendaftaran Syarikat: 16562 -K), suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan\ndi bawah Akta Syarikat 2016 [ Akta 777 ] dan mempunyai pejabat berdaftarnya\ndi Aras 30, Menara Bank Pembangunan, Plaza Conlay, Jalan Conlay, 50450 Kuala Lumpur\ndaripada pemakaian subseksyen 28(3A) Akta bagi maksud memberikan—\n\n(a) Pembiayaan Tawarruq untuk Modal Kerja Tetap (RC1)\n(Nombor Akaun: 00153400022) selama tempoh empat tahun;\n\n(b) Pembiayaan Tawarruq untuk Modal Kerja Tetap (RC2)\n(Nombor Akaun: 00153400023001) selama tempoh empat tahun; dan\n\n(c) Kontrak FOREX Line -i (Nombor Akaun: 00153400023002)\nselama tempoh enam bulan,\n\nkepada Lumut Naval Shipyard Sdn. Bhd. (Nombor Pendaftaran Syarikat: 199001007732\n[199302-K]), suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di bawah Akta Syarikat 2016\nyang syernya dimiliki sepenuhnya secara tidak langsung oleh seorang anggota\nBank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad yang merupakan Menteri Kewangan\n(\"Perbadanan\") yang diperbadankan di bawah subseksyen 3(1) Akta Menteri Kewangan\n(Pemerbadanan) 1957 [Akta 375].\n\nDibuat 24 Ogos 2026\n[MOF.SID(R)700-1/1/30 JLD. 3 (2); PN(PU2)625/III]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nDEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS ACT 2002\n\nDEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS\n(BANK PEMBANGUNAN MALAYSIA BERHAD) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 122 of the Development Financial\nInstitutions Act 2002 [ Act 618 ], the Minister, upon the recommendation of the Bank,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-9"};
